:: Mansion Steal Cooking Valid Calm
<<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<set $avery_passage to $passage>><<set $outside to 0>><<effects>><<avery_mansion>>
<<speechresolve>>
<<if setup.foodstuff[$phase2]?.recipe>>
	<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 100>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
	<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
		<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
			"I wanted to cook <<recipe_name $phase2 "article">>," you say, relieved that the first answer in your head is actually true. <span class="green">You're a natural.</span>
		<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
			"I was preparing <<recipe_name $phase2 "article">>," you say, as if the broken jar is just an unfortunate side note. <span class="green">You're a natural.</span>
		<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
			"I was making <<recipe_name $phase2 "article">>," you answer at once. <span class="green">You're a natural.</span>
		<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
			"I was cooking <<recipe_name $phase2 "article">>," you say. "The jar was just in the wrong place." <span class="green">You're a natural.</span>
		<<else>>
			"I wanted to cook <<recipe_name $phase2 "article">>," you answer almost automatically. <span class="green">You're a natural.</span>
		<</if>>
		<br><br>
		Avery's attention moves from the <<recipe_name $phase "plural">> to the open cupboard. The explanation fits before suspicion can settle.<br><br>
		"Makes sense," Avery says, stepping away from the doorframe. "<<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>>Don't forget to clean the kitchen afterwards.<<else>>Leave the mess for the maid.<<if $avery_mansion.schedule is "dinner">> I'll be waiting in the dining room.<</if>><</if>>"
		<br><br>
		<<He>> <<if $avery_mansion.schedule is "dinner">>returns to the dining room. Avery is hungry, so this will have to wait.<<else>>leaves the kitchen.<</if>>
	<<else>>
		<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
			"I wanted to cook... <<recipe_name $phase2 "article">>?" you say, not sounding convincing even to yourself.
		<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
			"I was going for <<recipe_name $phase2 "article">>," you say, holding your expression together by force.
		<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
			"<<recipe_name $phase2 "cap">>," you say quickly. "I mean, I was trying to make that."
		<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
			"<<recipe_name $phase2 "cap">>," you say, like that should be obvious. It is not.
		<<else>>
			"I wanted to cook... <<recipe_name $phase2 "article">>?" you say, not sounding convincing at all.
		<</if>>
		<br><br>
		Avery watches you for a moment, then chuckles. "<span class="green">Alright, keep your secrets.</span> I'll trust your surprise. <<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>>Just don't forget to clean the kitchen afterwards.<<else>>Just be careful in the future.<</if>>"
		<br><br>
		<<He>> releases the doorframe and <<if $avery_mansion.schedule is "dinner">>returns to the dining room.<<else>>leaves the kitchen.<</if>>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 400>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
	<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
		<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
			"I wanted to cook <<recipe_name $phase2 "article">>," you say, hoping the made-up recipe sounds less made-up than it is.
		<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
			"I was attempting <<recipe_name $phase2 "article">>," you say, giving the name as much dignity as possible.
		<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
			"I was trying to make <<recipe_name $phase2 "article">>," you answer.
		<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
			"I was making <<recipe_name $phase2 "article">>," you say, daring the recipe to exist.
		<<else>>
			"I wanted to cook <<recipe_name $phase2 "article">>," you answer, as if you did not make that recipe up on the spot.
		<</if>>
		<br><br>
		Avery raises <<his>> eyebrow. "<<recipe_name $phase2 "cap">>? I never asked you to make that before." <<He>> thinks for a moment, then smiles. "I'll keep that in mind. <<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>>Don't forget to clean the kitchen afterwards.<<else>>Leave the mess for the maid.<<if $avery_mansion.schedule is "dinner">> I'll be waiting in the dining room.<</if>><</if>>"
		<br><br>
		<<He>> steps away from the doorframe and <<if $avery_mansion.schedule is "dinner">>returns to the dining room.<<else>>leaves the kitchen.<</if>>
	<<else>>
		The name leaves your mouth before you can think of a better one.<br><br>
		"I wanted to cook... <<recipe_name $phase2 "article">>?" you say, grabbing a recipe name that you assume uses <<recipe_name $phase>>.<br><br>
		Avery raises <<his>> eyebrow, then smirks. "<<recipe_name $phase2 "cap">>? I didn't know you knew that one. Alright. Change of plans. <span class="pink">Make <<recipe_name $phase2 "article">> instead of <<recipe_name $avery_mansion.food "article">></span>."
		<<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>>
			<br><br>"And don't forget to clean the kitchen afterwards."
		<</if>>
		<br><br>
		<<averyKitchenExit "calm">><<if $avery_mansion.schedule is "dinner">> You will need to finish this after dinner.<<else>> You are in trouble.<</if>>
	<</if>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<icon "avery-kitchen.png">><<link [[Next|Mansion Kitchen]]>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Mansion Steal Raw
<<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<set $avery_passage to $passage>><<set $outside to 0>><<effects>><<avery_mansion>>
"I crave raw meat," you announce nonchalantly, your animalistic nature taking control for a moment. 
<br><br>
Avery just stares at you for a moment in bewilderment, waiting for further explanation.
<br><br>
<<link [[Bite into the <<recipe_name $phase "article">> to prove a point|Mansion Steal Raw Prove]]>><</link>><br>
<<link [[Explain|Mansion Steal Raw Explain]]>><</link>><br>
<<link [[Remain silent|Mansion Steal Raw Silent]]>><</link>>

:: Mansion Steal Raw Prove
<<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<set $avery_passage to $passage>><<set $outside to 0>><<effects>><<avery_mansion>>
You bite into the <<recipe_name $phase "article">> slowly. It's actually very good, it makes you happy.<<lstress>><<stress -2>>
<br><br>
You devour the rest of the <<recipe_name $phase "article">> quickly, and when you look back up at Avery, you realize <<hes>> already gone.<<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>> You still should clean it up afterwards though.<</if>>
<br><br>
<<icon "avery-kitchen.png">><<link [[Next|Mansion Kitchen]]>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Mansion Steal Raw Explain
<<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<set $avery_passage to $passage>><<set $outside to 0>><<effects>><<avery_mansion>>
<<speechresolve>>
<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
	"I'm a <<if (effectiveTransformationLevel("cat") gte 6)>>cat<<girl>><<elseif (effectiveTransformationLevel("wolf") gte 6)>>wolf<<girl>><<elseif (effectiveTransformationLevel("bear") gte 6)>>bear<<girl>><<elseif (effectiveTransformationLevel("fox") gte 6)>>fox<<girl>><<elseif (effectiveTransformationLevel("bird") gte 6)>>harpy<</if>>," you say. "Raw meat actually makes me happy. I know it's strange."
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
	"I can explain," you say. "My instincts are not being very polite today. Raw <<recipe_name $phase>> sounded good."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	"I wanted raw meat," you say. "It felt natural. I can put it back."
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
	"I'm a <<if (effectiveTransformationLevel("cat") gte 6)>>cat<<girl>><<elseif (effectiveTransformationLevel("wolf") gte 6)>>wolf<<girl>><<elseif (effectiveTransformationLevel("bear") gte 6)>>bear<<girl>><<elseif (effectiveTransformationLevel("fox") gte 6)>>fox<<girl>><<elseif (effectiveTransformationLevel("bird") gte 6)>>harpy<</if>>," you say. "What did you expect? Sometimes I want meat."
<<else>>
	"I craved raw meat," you say. "It sounds odd, but it feels natural now."
<</if>>
<br><br>
Avery's disgust is obvious, but <<he>> does not look surprised for long.
"Fine. Take a little, directly from here." <<He>> points at the counter. "And if you make yourself sick, don't expect sympathy."
<br><br>
<<averyKitchenExit "calm">><<tending_pick $phase 1 1>><<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>>Avery did not mention it, but you probably still have to clean the kitchen.<</if>>
<br><br>
<<icon "avery-kitchen.png">><<link [[Next|Mansion Kitchen]]>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Mansion Steal Raw Silent
<<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<set $avery_passage to $passage>><<set $outside to 0>><<effects>><<avery_mansion>>
<<if $phase is "beef">>"You could make steak tartare.<<else>>"At least put it on some bread.<</if>>", Avery starts. "There are better ways to phrase it. Some that don't make you sound like a barbarian." <<He>> sighs. "Do with it whatever you want.<<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>> Just clean it up first.<</if>>"
<br><br>
<<averyKitchenExit "calm">><<tending_pick $phase 2 4>>
<br><br>
<<icon "avery-kitchen.png">><<link [[Next|Mansion Kitchen]]>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Mansion Steal Child
<<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<set $avery_passage to $passage>><<set $outside to 0>><<effects>><<avery_mansion>>
"I need to feed my child."<br>
"Children don't eat raw <<recipe_name $phase>>"<br>
"Wolf children do."
<br><br>
There is an uncomfortable silence between you two before Avery raises <<his>> voice. "You have a child with some filthy animal!? Are you out of your mind?"
<<if C.npc.Avery.rage gte random(20, 100) and $averyragerevealed is 1>>
	Avery steps closer and grasps both of your arms. It hurts.<<gpain>><<gtrauma>><<gstress>><<pain 4>><<trauma 6>><<stress 6>>
	<br><br>
	"Leave that $phase alone and don't even fucking mention that anymore. You're here, you're mine and I am not sharing you with any animal in that forest.<<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>> And clean this mess.<</if>>"<<gstress>><<stress 6>><<ggarage>><<npcincr Avery rage 3>>
<<else>>
    <br><br>
	Avery takes a good while to compose <<himself>>, then forces a smile. "Don't go there anymore. It's not your life now.<<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>> Clean this mess.<</if>>"<<gstress>><<stress 6>><<garage>><<npcincr Avery rage 1>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<averyKitchenExit "calm">>
<br><br>
<<set $weekly.theft.avery_mansion.Ban to true>>
<<icon "avery-kitchen.png">><<link [[Next|Mansion Kitchen]]>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Mansion Steal Friend
<<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<set $avery_passage to $passage>><<set $outside to 0>><<effects>><<avery_mansion>>
<<speechresolve>>
<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
	"I thought about giving it to a friend.
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
	"It was meant as a gift for a friend.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	"It's for a friend," you say. "I can leave it.
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
	"It's for a friend. Not everything in the world is about you.
<<else>>
	"I wanted to give it to a friend.
<</if>>
<<if $phase2 is "wolf">>
	<<nnpc_hes "Black Wolf">> a wolf.<<if (effectiveTransformationLevel("wolf") gte 6)>> A bit more wolfy than me.<</if>>
<<else>>
	<<nnpc_hes "Great Hawk">> a hawk.<<if (effectiveTransformationLevel("bird") gte 6)>> A bit more hawky than me.<</if>>
<</if>>
"<br><br>
"You were going to steal the food I buy and give it to some wild animal?"
<<if $phase2 is "wolf">>
	<<He>> rubs <<his>> temple, as if the word wolf has given <<him>> a headache.
<<else>>
	<<He>> glances towards the window, as if expecting the Great Hawk to be waiting outside.
<</if>>
"Leave it here. If your friend is hungry, they can hunt. <<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>>You can start by cleaning this mess.<<else>>And you can stop making a mess in my kitchen.<</if>>"<<garage>><<npcincr Avery rage 1>>
<br><br>
<<averyKitchenExit "calm">>
<br><br>
<<icon "avery-kitchen.png">><<link [[Next|Mansion Kitchen]]>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Mansion Steal Honey
<<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<set $avery_passage to $passage>><<set $outside to 0>><<effects>><<avery_mansion>>
<<speechresolve>>
"I really like honey."
<br>
"It's a honeycomb, not honey," Avery says, unimpressed.
<br>
<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
	"I like it from the source," you answer before you can stop yourself. "Wax and all."
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
	"Fresh from the source has its own charm," you say, then realise how that sounds.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	"It's better like this," you say. "I mean, I think so."
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
	"It's better fresh from the source," you say. "The wax is part of the fun."
<<else>>
	"It's better fresh from the source," you answer, your animalistic nature speaking before your manners can catch up.
<</if>>
<br><br>
Avery stares for a moment, then grimaces. "That's disgusting. Just make honey with it.<<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>> And clean it up.<</if>>"
<<averyKitchenExit "calm">>
<br><br>
<<icon "avery-kitchen.png">><<link [[Next|Mansion Kitchen]]>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Mansion Steal Honey Prove
<<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<set $avery_passage to $passage>><<set $outside to 0>><<effects>><<avery_mansion>>
You bite into the honeycomb slowly. You make some mess, but it doesn't matter much, as it makes something inside you very happy.<<lstress>><<stress -2>>
<br><br>
Soon enough the whole honeycomb is in your belly and you want to take a bit more. When you look back up at Avery, you realize <<hes>> already gone.<<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>> You still should clean it up afterwards though.<</if>>
<<avery_housework_change "kitchen" 1>>
<br><br>
<<icon "avery-kitchen.png">><<link [[Next|Mansion Kitchen]]>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Mansion Steal Honey Explain
<<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<set $avery_passage to $passage>><<set $outside to 0>><<effects>><<avery_mansion>>
<<speechresolve>>
<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
	"I wanted the honeycomb," you explain. "The whole thing. I know it sounds strange."
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
	"I had a craving for honeycomb," you say. "A very specific one, unfortunately."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	"I wanted to eat it," you say. "I'll leave it if you want."
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
	"I wanted the honeycomb," you say. "Not a spoonful of honey, the actual thing."
<<else>>
	"I wanted to eat the honeycomb," you explain. "Wax and all."
<</if>>
<br><br>
Avery looks at the sticky mess on the counter, then at you. "I'm not even going to ask why that made sense in your head. Leave it here.<<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>> Clean the floor before someone slips.<</if>>"<<garage>><<npcincr Avery rage 1>>
<br><br>
<<averyKitchenExit "calm">>
<br><br>
<<icon "avery-kitchen.png">><<link [[Next|Mansion Kitchen]]>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Mansion Steal Honey Silent
<<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<set $avery_passage to $passage>><<set $outside to 0>><<effects>><<avery_mansion>>
"This is disgusting. Just make honey with it.<<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>> And clean it up.<</if>>" <<averyKitchenExit "calm">>
<br><br>
<<icon "avery-kitchen.png">><<link [[Next|Mansion Kitchen]]>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Mansion Steal Surprise
<<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<set $avery_passage to $passage>><<set $outside to 0>><<effects>><<avery_mansion>>
<<speechresolve>>
<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
	"I wanted to make you a surprise," you say, clutching the <<recipe_name $phase "plural">> like evidence and gift at the same time.
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
	"It was meant to be a surprise," you say. "A nice one, before the jar decided otherwise."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	"I was making you a surprise," you say. "I can stop."
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
	"Can't tell you," you say. "That ruins the surprise."
<<else>>
	"I wanted to make you a surprise."
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<switch $phase>>
<<case "beef">>
	"A surprise?" Avery's expression softens despite <<himself>>. It seems <<he>> has something very particular in mind. "I might excuse your clumsiness if you're making what I think you're making."
<<case "pasta">>
	"A surprise?" Avery's expression softens. "<<if !Array.isArray($foodstuff.linguine?.knownFavorite)>>I might excuse your clumsiness if you make it good.<<else>>I might excuse your clumsiness if it's linguine.<</if>>"
<<case "sugar">>
	"A surprise?" Avery raises <<his>> eyebrow, <<his>> expression easing a little. "Dessert, I hope. It had better be worth the mess you've made."
<<case "flour">>
	"A surprise?" Avery raises <<his>> eyebrow. "Baking for me? It had better be worth the mess you've made."
<<default>>
	"A surprise?" Avery raises <<his>> eyebrow, <<his>> expression softening slightly. "It had better be worth the mess you've made."
<</switch>>
<br><br>
<<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>>
	"Clean it up first."
<</if>>
<<averyKitchenExit "calm">>
<br><br>
<<icon "avery-kitchen.png">><<link [[Next|Mansion Kitchen]]>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Mansion Steal Admit 2
<<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<set $avery_passage to $passage>><<set $outside to 0>><<effects>><<avery_mansion>>
<<speechresolve>>
<<set $weekly.theft.avery_mansion.Ban to true>>
<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
	"I was trying to steal it," you say, because a second lie feels impossible.
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
	"There isn't a better way to put it," you say. "I was stealing."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	"I stole it," you say. "I'm sorry."
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
	"Fine. I was stealing," you say. "There."
<<else>>
	"I was trying to steal it," you say.
<</if>>
<br><br>
Avery's jaw tightens. "At least you can say it. Leave the <<recipe_name $phase "plural">> here.<<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>> Clean up the mess.<<else>> And stop breaking things in my kitchen.<</if>>"<<garage>><<npcincr Avery rage 1>>
<br><br>
<<averyKitchenExit "calm">>
<br><br>
<<icon "avery-kitchen.png">><<link [[Next|Mansion Kitchen]]>><<endevent>><</link>>

