<</if>>

:: Kitchen Steal Fight Finish
<<effects>>
<<if $enemypleasure gte $enemypleasuremax>>
	<<ejaculation>>
	Avery tries to lean on the wall for support, but slumps to <<his>> arse instead. <<tearful>> you step away from <<him>>.
	<br><br>
	<<He>> pushes <<himself>> to <<his>> feet, regards you a moment, then walks away. 
	<<avery_housework_change "kitchen" 1>>
	<<clotheson>><<endcombat>>
	<<link [[Next|Mansion Kitchen]]>><</link>>
<<elseif $enemyhealth lte 0>>
	You smack Avery away from you. <<He>> collides with the wall, and slumps onto <<his>> arse. <<tearful>> you step away from <<him>>.
	<br><br>
	<<He>> pushes <<himself>> to <<his>> feet, regards you a moment, then walks away.
	<<avery_housework_change "kitchen" 1>>
	<<clotheson>><<endcombat>>
	<<link [[Next|Mansion Kitchen]]>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<tearful>> you fall to the ground. You're too hurt to continue fighting.
	<br><br>
	Avery hauls you to your feet, and pushes you ahead of <<him>>.
	<<avery_housework_change "kitchen" 1>>
	<<clotheson>><<endcombat>>
	<<link [[Next|Mansion Kitchen]]>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: Mansion Steal Cooking Valid Rage
<<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<set $avery_passage to $passage>><<set $outside to 0>><<effects>><<avery_mansion>>
<<if setup.foodstuff[$phase2]?.recipe>>
	<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 400>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
	<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
