		<br><br>
		"Hm. Makes sense," Avery says, stepping away from the doorframe. "<<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>>Clean it up.<<else>>Leave it for the maid to clean.<<if $avery_mansion.schedule is "dinner">> I'll be waiting in the dining room.<</if>><</if>> And don't make another mess."
		<br><br>
