			<<if $syndromewolves gte 1>>
				<<link [[Say you wanted to give it to Black Wolf|Mansion Steal Friend Rage]]>><<set $phase2 to "wolf">><</link>><br>
			<</if>>
			<<if $syndromebird gte 1>>
				<<link [[Say you wanted to give it to the Great Hawk|Mansion Steal Friend Rage]]>><<set $phase2 to "bird">><</link>><br>
			<</if>>
		<</if>>
		<<if (effectiveTransformationLevel("bear") gte 6) and $phase is "wild_honeycomb">>
			<<link [[Say you like honey|Mansion Steal Honey Rage]]>><</link>><br>
		<</if>>
		<<link [[Say you're making a surprise|Mansion Steal Surprise Rage]]>><</link>><br>
		<<link [[Say you wanted to give it to the orphans|Mansion Steal Orphans Rage]]>><</link>><br>
		<<if effectiveTransformationLevel("fox") gte 2 and $phase is "chicken_egg">>
			<<link [[Defend stealing as your natural need|Mansion Steal Fox Rage]]>><</link>><br>
		<<else>>
			<<link [[Admit to stealing|Mansion Steal Admit Rage]]>><</link>><br>
		<</if>>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 900>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
	<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
		"I wanted to cook <<recipe_name $phase2 "article">>," you answer almost automatically, as if you didn't make that recipe up on the spot.
		<br><br>
		"Huh. I didn't know you knew how to make that. I'll keep it in mind." Avery points at the mess. "<<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>>Clean it up.<<else>>Leave it for the maid to clean.<<if $avery_mansion.schedule is "dinner">> I'll be waiting in the dining room.<</if>><</if>> And don't make another mess."
		<br><br>
		<<He>> leaves the kitchen.
		<br><br>
		<<icon "avery-kitchen.png">><<link [[Next|Mansion Kitchen]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<<else>>
		"I wanted to cook... <<recipe_name $phase2 "article">>?" you say, grabbing a recipe name that you assume uses <<recipe_name $phase>>.
		<br><br>
		Avery studies your face for too long. "No. You are holding something back. What is it?"<<gstress>><<stress 6>>
		<br><br>		
		<<link [[Say you wanted to get a hidden food stash|Mansion Steal Stash Rage]]>><</link>><br>
		<<if (effectiveTransformationLevel("fox") gte 6) and $phase is "chicken_egg">>
			<<link [[Say you wanted to bury the egg|Mansion Steal Bury Egg Rage]]>><</link>><br>
