	<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
		"I'm experimenting," you answer. "That is how cooking works."
	<<else>>
		"I'm experimenting," you answer confidently.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	"That's all?" Avery almost sounds surprised by how confident you are. Then <<he>> scoffs. "And yet you're making such a mess over it. <<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>>Clean it up, and <<else>>The maid can clean it up, but <</if>>don't make another mess.<<if $avery_mansion.schedule is "dinner">> I'll be waiting in the dining room.<</if>>"
	<br><br>
	<<He>> leaves the kitchen.
	<br><br>
	<<icon "avery-kitchen.png">><<link [[Next|Mansion Kitchen]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<<else>>
	"I was thinking about mixing some <<recipe_name $phase>> with <<recipe_name $phase2>>, yeah," you say, not sounding sure of yourself.
	<br><br>
	"Stop fucking lying to me, you ungrateful brat," Avery says, coming closer. "I'll show you what I do to liars."<<garage>><<gtrauma>><<gstress>><<npcincr Avery rage 3>><<trauma 6>><<stress 6>>
