:: Mansion Steal Bury Egg Rage
<<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<set $avery_passage to $passage>><<set $outside to 0>><<effects>><<avery_mansion>>
<<speechresolve>>
<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
	"I just wanted to bury the egg," you start your explanation. "I really felt like I needed to."<br>
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
	"I felt the need to bury an egg, so I took the egg," you say it as if it was the most obvious thing in the world
<<else>>
	"I wanted to bury the egg," you say it as if it was the most obvious thing in the world.
<</if>>
<br><br>
Avery stares at you, as if waiting for you to explain. When that explanation doesn't come - <<he>> frowns. "You wanted to bury it? That's it?"
<br><br>
"Well, I'm a fox<<girl>>," you says.
<br><br>
<<if Transformations.partActive("fox", "ears")>>"I know, I'm not blind,"<<else>>"I know, I'm not stupid,"<</if>> <<he>> barks. "I just thought you'd at least try to hide the fact that you made such a mess over something so stupid.
<<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>>
	Clean it up. 
<<else>>
	Don't do it in the future. 
<</if>>
And put the egg down, you aren't burying shit."
<br><br>
<<averyKitchenExit "rage">><<if $avery_mansion.schedule is "dinner">>For now, Avery expects you back in the dining room.<</if>>
<br><br>
<<set $weekly.theft.avery_mansion.Ban to true>>
<<icon "avery-kitchen.png">><<link [[Next|Mansion Kitchen]]>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Mansion Steal Save Rage
<<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<set $avery_passage to $passage>><<set $outside to 0>><<effects>><<avery_mansion>>
<<speechresolve>>
<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
	"I thought I'd need <<recipe_name $phase "plural">> later," you say. "I didn't want the kitchen to run short."
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
	"You only keep three ingredients stocked at once, and I'll need <<recipe_name $phase "plural">> later, so I decided to stock up early."
<<else>>
	"I wanted to keep it for later. I should have asked for more ingredients instead of taking them."
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<if $avery_mansion.kitchen_stock.requested.shift() is $phase>>
	<<set $avery_mansion.kitchen_stock.requested.pushUnique($phase)>>
	<<set _removed_ingredient to $avery_mansion.kitchen_stock.requested.shift()>>
	Avery sighs, then nods. "Right. I'll keep that in mind. I'll get rid of <<recipe_name _removed_ingredient "plural">> instead."
<<else>>
	Avery frowns. "I wouldn't have got rid of that. The next to go are <<recipe_name $avery_mansion.kitchen_stock.requested.shift() "plural">>."
<</if>>
<br><br>
"Put the <<recipe_name $phase "plural">> back. They are not going anywhere. <<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>>Then clean this up.<<else>>And leave the rest of the kitchen alone.<</if>>"
<br><br>
<<averyKitchenExit "rage">><<if $avery_mansion.schedule is "dinner">>This can wait until Avery is no longer hungry.<</if>>
<br><br>
<<icon "avery-kitchen.png">><<link [[Next|Mansion Kitchen]]>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Mansion Steal Save Rage Fail
<<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<set $avery_passage to $passage>><<set $outside to 0>><<effects>><<avery_mansion>>
<<speechresolve>>
<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
	"I thought I'd need <<recipe_name $phase "plural">> for cooking," you say. "I should have asked before taking them."
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
	"I was trying to plan ahead," you say. "Clearly I chose the wrong way to do it."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	"I wanted to save it," you say. "I thought it would help."
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
	"I was stocking up," you say. "You can't blame me for thinking ahead."
<<else>>
	"I wanted to keep it for later. The kitchen runs short quickly, but I should have asked."
<</if>>
<br><br>
"Keep it for later?" Avery steps closer. "You're fucking lying to me again. I'll show you what I do to liars."<<garage>><<gtrauma>><<gstress>><<npcincr Avery rage 3>><<trauma 6>><<stress 6>>
<br><br>
<<set $weekly.theft.avery_mansion.Ban to true>>
<<link [[Next|Kitchen Steal Fight]]>><<set $fightstart to 1>><</link>>

:: Mansion Steal Child Rage
<<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<set $avery_passage to $passage>><<set $outside to 0>><<effects>><<avery_mansion>>
"I need to feed my child."<br>
"Children are not an excuse to chew raw <<recipe_name $phase>>."<br>
"Wolf children do."
<br><br>
The kitchen goes horribly quiet. Then Avery's voice rises. "You have a child with some filthy animal!? Are you out of your mind?"
Avery steps closer and grasps both of your arms. It hurts.<<gpain>><<gtrauma>><<gstress>><<pain 4>><<trauma 6>><<stress 6>><br>
<br><br>
"Leave that <<recipe_name $phase>> alone and don't even fucking mention that anymore. You're here, you're mine and I am not sharing you with any animal in that forest.<<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>> And clean this mess.<</if>>"<<gstress>><<stress 6>><<ggarage>><<npcincr Avery rage 3>>
<br><br>
<<averyKitchenExit "rage">><<averyKitchenPillConsequence>><<set $weekly.theft.avery_mansion.Ban to true>>
<br><br>
<<icon "avery-kitchen.png">><<link [[Next|Mansion Kitchen]]>><<endevent>><</link>>

