:: Mansion Steal Orphans Rage
<<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<set $avery_passage to $passage>><<set $outside to 0>><<effects>><<avery_mansion>>
<<speechresolve>>
<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
	"I felt bad for the other orphans," you say. "I wanted to share."
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
	"I meant to take it to the orphanage," you say. "It seemed kinder than leaving it here."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	"I wanted to give it to the orphans," you say, voice small.
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
	"Bailey's cheap," you say. "Someone should feed them properly."
<<else>>
	"I wanted to give it to the other orphans."
<</if>>
<br><br>
Avery's face goes dark. "So that's how you're repaying me? I take you in, provide for you, and you come here to steal from me for people you barely even speak to?"
<br><br>
<<He>> closes in and grips your arm. "After all this, you still try me."<<garage>><<gtrauma>><<gstress>><<npcincr Avery rage 3>><<trauma 6>><<stress 6>>
<br><br>
<<set $weekly.theft.avery_mansion.Ban to true>>
<<link [[Next|Kitchen Steal Fight]]>><<set $fightstart to 1>><</link>>

:: Mansion Steal Admit Rage
<<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<set $avery_passage to $passage>><<set $outside to 0>><<effects>><<avery_mansion>>
<<speechresolve>>
<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
	"I'm sorry," you mumble. "I tried to steal from you."
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
	"I was stealing," you say, too late for politeness to save you.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	"I stole it," you say. "I'm sorry."
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
	"Fine. I was stealing," you say, even as Avery's expression turns dangerous.
<<else>>
	"I'm sorry," you say. "I tried to steal from you."
<</if>>
<br><br>
"So that's your answer?" Avery's eye twitches. "I bring you into my home, and you treat my kitchen like something to pick clean?"
<br><br>
<<He>> gets closer and grabs your arm. "You have the nerve."<<garage>><<gtrauma>><<gstress>><<npcincr Avery rage 3>><<trauma 6>><<stress 6>>
<br><br>
<<set $weekly.theft.avery_mansion.Ban to true>>
<<link [[Next|Kitchen Steal Fight]]>><<set $fightstart to 1>><</link>>

:: Mansion Steal Fox
<<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<set $avery_passage to $passage>><<set $outside to 0>><<effects>><<avery_mansion>>
"Well, I'm a fox<<girl>>, stealing is my natural need," you try to explain yourself.
<br><br>
"Huh, at least you're honest." Avery sighs. "I'll overlook it this time, but don't do it again.<<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>> And clean it up.<</if>>"<<garage>><<npcincr Avery rage 1>>
<br><br>
<<averyKitchenExit "calm">><<if $avery_mansion.schedule is "dinner">>The kitchen can wait. Avery cannot, apparently.<</if>>
<br><br>
<<set $weekly.theft.avery_mansion.Ban to true>>
<<icon "avery-kitchen.png">><<link [[Next|Mansion Kitchen]]>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Mansion Steal Fox Rage
<<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<set $avery_passage to $passage>><<set $outside to 0>><<effects>><<avery_mansion>>
"Fox<<girl>> instinct," you say, trying to make theft sound like biology.
<br><br>
"So that's your excuse?" Avery's eye twitches. "You dress up theft as instinct and expect me to smile?" <<He>> grabs your arm, grip sharp. "Not happening."<<garage>><<gtrauma>><<gstress>><<npcincr Avery rage 3>><<trauma 6>><<stress 6>>
<br><br>
<<set $weekly.theft.avery_mansion.Ban to true>>
<<link [[Next|Kitchen Steal Fight]]>><<set $fightstart to 1>><</link>>

:: Mansion Steal Stash Calm
<<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<set $avery_passage to $passage>><<set $outside to 0>><<effects>><<avery_mansion>>
<<speechresolve>>
<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
	"I started keeping some snacks hidden away," you say, voice small. "I should have asked first. I'm sorry."
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
	"I was putting together a small private stash," you admit. "It sounds worse now that I have to say it aloud."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	"I was hiding it for later," you say, already lowering your eyes. "I can put it back."
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
	"It was going in my stash," you say, glancing at the broken jar. "Not exactly hidden now, is it?"
<<else>>
	"I was trying to stock a hidden food stash," you say. "It sounded less stupid before you walked in."
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<if setup.foodstuff[$phase].category is "fruit" or setup.foodstuff[$phase].category is "vegetable">>
	<<if $phase is "lemon" or $phase is "lime">>
		"You were going to sit somewhere and eat <<recipe_name $phase "article">> by itself?" Avery winces at the idea. <<if playerBellyVisible() or knowsAboutPregnancy("pc", "Avery")>>"Pregnancy has done strange things to your appetite.<<else>>"At least put some sugar on it.<</if>>
		<<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>> Still, clean this up first.<<else>> Still, be more careful in future.<</if>>"
        <br><br>
		<<averyKitchenExit "calm">> You decide to still take some. <<tending_pick $phase 2 4>>
		<br><br>
		<<icon "avery-kitchen.png">><<link [[Next|Mansion Kitchen]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<<elseif $phase is "chilli_pepper">>
		"You wanted to keep a hidden stash of chilli pepper?" <<He>> raises <<his>> eyebrow. "That's brave.
        <<if playerBellyVisible() or knowsAboutPregnancy("pc", "Avery")>>But that is one of the odder cravings you could have picked.<</if>><<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>> Still, clean this up first.<<else>> Still, be more careful in future.<</if>>"
		<br><br>
        <<averyKitchenExit "calm">> You decide to still take some. <<tending_pick $phase 2 4>>
		<br><br>
		<<icon "avery-kitchen.png">><<link [[Next|Mansion Kitchen]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<<elseif $phase is "wheat">>
		<<if (effectiveTransformationLevel("cow") gte 6)>>
			"You want to snack on wheat." Avery raises <<his>> eyebrow and chuckles. "That makes sense actually. Sure, take some. It will make a good snack for you."
			<br><br>
            <<averyKitchenExit "calm">><<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>> You should clean it up.<</if>>
		<<elseif playerBellyVisible() or knowsAboutPregnancy("pc", "Avery")>>
			"Excuse me, you wanted to eat wheat?" <<He>> chuckles. "Your cravings are making bold choices today." <<He>> stops for a moment, thinking. "Sure, take it."
			<br><br>
			<<averyKitchenExit "calm">><span class="blue">Something tells you eating raw grains while pregnant probably is not a good idea.</span><<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>> You also probably should clean up the mess you've made.<</if>>
		<<else>>
			"Excuse me, you wanted to eat wheat?" <<He>> chuckles. "Now that's a new one. Sure, take it. It should make a good snack for you."
			<br><br>
			<<averyKitchenExit "calm">><<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>> You should clean it up.<</if>>
		<</if>>
		<<tending_pick $phase 3 6>>
		<br><br>
		<<icon "avery-kitchen.png">><<link [[Next|Mansion Kitchen]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<<elseif $phase is "rice">>
		"Excuse me, you wanted to eat uncooked rice?
		<<if (effectiveTransformationLevel("cow") gte 6)>>
			Why?"
            <br><br>
            You just moo in response and prove your point by putting the grain in your mouth. It's actually not that bad.<<lstress>><<stress -2>>
            <br><br>
			"Just... <<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>>Clean up the mess,<<else>>Don't send anything else across the floor,<</if>>" <<he>> says clearly resigned. <<averyKitchenExit "calm">>
		<<elseif playerBellyVisible() or knowsAboutPregnancy("pc", "Avery")>> Pregnancy cravings make poor arguments, but Avery seems willing to hear this one.<<if $averyragerevealed>> "It still does not explain the mess," <<he>> adds.<</if>><<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>> Put it down and clean up the mess.<<else>> Put it down.<</if>> If you want rice, you'll have to cook it first."
			<br><br>
            <<averyKitchenExit "calm">>
		<<else>>
			<<averyKitchenNoExcuse>><br><br><<averyKitchenExit "calm">>
			<<set $weekly.theft.avery_mansion.Ban to true>>
		<</if>>
		<br><br>
		<<icon "avery-kitchen.png">><<link [[Next|Mansion Kitchen]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<<elseif $phase is "potato">>
		"Excuse me, you wanted to eat a raw potato?
		<<if playerBellyVisible() or knowsAboutPregnancy("pc", "Avery")>> Avery eyes your belly, then the food. "Pregnancy cravings are one thing. This is still ridiculous."<<if $averyragerevealed>> <<He>> clicks <<his>> tongue.<</if>><<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>> Put it down and clean up the mess.<<else>> Put it down.<</if>> If you want potatoes, you'll have to cook them."
			<br><br>
            <<averyKitchenExit "calm">>
		<<else>>
			<<averyKitchenNoExcuse>><br><br><<averyKitchenExit "calm">>
			<<set $weekly.theft.avery_mansion.Ban to true>>
		<</if>>
		<br><br>
		<<icon "avery-kitchen.png">><<link [[Next|Mansion Kitchen]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<<elseif $phase is "onion">>
		"And what next? You'd just bite into <<recipe_name $phase "article">> as if it were an apple?" Avery raises <<his>> eyebrow at the idea. <<if playerBellyVisible() or knowsAboutPregnancy("pc", "Avery")>>"I suppose that's what happens when you're pregnant.<<else>>"At least prepare it.<</if>>
		<<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>> Still, clean this up first.<<else>> Still, be more careful in future.<</if>>"
		<br><br>
        <<averyKitchenExit "calm">> You decide to still take some. <<tending_pick $phase 2 4>>
		<br><br>
		<<icon "avery-kitchen.png">><<link [[Next|Mansion Kitchen]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<<elseif $phase is "garlic_bulb">>
		"You definitely shouldn't just be biting into it." Avery sighs. <<if playerBellyVisible() or knowsAboutPregnancy("pc", "Avery")>>"Pregnancy has given you strange standards for food.<<else>><</if>>
		<<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>> Still, clean this up first.<<else>> Still, be more careful in future.<</if>>"
		<br><br>
        <<averyKitchenExit "calm">>
		<br><br>
		<<icon "avery-kitchen.png">><<link [[Next|Mansion Kitchen]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<<elseif $phase is "wild_carrot" and (effectiveTransformationLevel("bunny") gte 6)>>
		Avery chuckles. "Obviously. How befitting of you, my bunny. Keep as many of them as you want." <<if $bodysize lte 2.5>><<He>> pats your head<<else>><<He>> pats your shoulder<</if>> before leaving the kitchen. <span class="gold">It makes you feel very good.</span><<npcincr Avery dom 1>><<gdom>><br>
		You decide to take more than you previously intended.
		<<tending_pick $phase 5 10>><<set $weekly.theft.mansion[$phase] to false>><<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>> You still need to clean up the mess.<</if>>
	<<else>>
		"You don't need to sneak around for <<recipe_name $phase>>," <<he>> sighs. "Just take it directly from the kitchen.
		<<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>> And clean this up first.<<else>> And be more careful in future.<</if>>"
		<br><br>
        <<averyKitchenExit "calm">>
		<br><br>
		<<icon "avery-kitchen.png">><<link [[Next|Mansion Kitchen]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<</if>>
<<elseif setup.foodstuff[$phase].category is "mushroom">>
	"That would not be my first pick for a snack, but I have heard stranger things from you," <<he>> sighs. "Ask first, then take it from the kitchen next time.
	<<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>> Clean this up.<<else>> Be more careful in future.<</if>>"
	<br><br>
    <<averyKitchenExit "calm">>
	<br><br>
	<<icon "avery-kitchen.png">><<link [[Next|Mansion Kitchen]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<<elseif setup.foodstuff[$phase].category is "produce">>
	<<switch $phase>>
		<<case "bottle_of_milk">>
			"And what then? You'd just drink it?" <<He>> raises <<his>> eyebrow.
			<<if (effectiveTransformationLevel("cat") gte 6)>>
				"Sure, take some. Just not too many. I suppose you do look the part. 
				<<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>>
					 And clean it up too.
				<</if>>
				"<<He>> leaves the kitchen.
                <br><br>
				<<tending_pick $phase 1 2>>
				<br><br>
				<<icon "avery-kitchen.png">><<link [[Next|Mansion Kitchen]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
			<<else>>
				<br>
				"Yes, pretty much."<br>
				<<if $averyragerevealed>>
					Avery sighs. "No. You are not taking that with you. Put it down.
					<<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>> Clean this up.<<else>> Be more careful in future.<</if>>"
					<<averyKitchenExit "calm">>
				<<elseif playerBellyVisible() or knowsAboutPregnancy("pc", "Avery")>>
					Avery sighs. "Pregnancy cravings are a strange defence. Fine, take some, just not too many.
					<<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>> Clean this up.<<else>> Be more careful in future.<</if>>"
					<<averyKitchenExit "calm">>
                    <br><br>
                    <<tending_pick $phase 1 1>>
				<<else>>
					Avery sighs. "Take it openly from the kitchen if you want it so much.
					<<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>> But clean up the mess first.<</if>>"
					<<averyKitchenExit "calm">>
				<</if>>
				<br><br>
				<<icon "avery-kitchen.png">><<link [[Next|Mansion Kitchen]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
			<</if>>
		<<case "cream">>
			<<if $averyragerevealed>>
				Avery sighs. "That stays here. Put it down before I change my mind.
				<<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>> Clean this up.<<else>> Be more careful in future.<</if>>"
				<<averyKitchenExit "calm">>
			<<elseif playerBellyVisible() or knowsAboutPregnancy("pc", "Avery")>>
				Avery sighs. "Pregnancy cravings, then. Fine, take some, just not too many.
				<<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>> Clean this up.<<else>> Be more careful in future.<</if>>"
				<<averyKitchenExit "calm">>
				<<tending_pick $phase 1 1>>
			<<else>>
				Avery sighs. "Ask for it properly next time, then take it from the kitchen.
				<<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>> But clean up the mess first.<</if>>"
				<<averyKitchenExit "calm">>
			<</if>>
			<br><br>
			<<icon "avery-kitchen.png">><<link [[Next|Mansion Kitchen]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
		<<case "bird_egg">>
			"You wanted to snack on a raw egg?"<br>
			<<if (effectiveTransformationLevel("fox") gte 6)>>
				"I'm a fox<<girl>>, it's my natural need."
                <br><br>
				"Fair enough. I suppose you do look the part. 
				<<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>>
					You made the mess, my <<= $player.gender_appearance is "m" ? "kit" : "vixen">>, so you clean it." <<He>> sighs. "Take the egg, and leave the rest of the kitchen standing.
				<<else>>
					Leave the mess for the maids." <<He>> pauses, then lets out a sigh. "Fine. Take the egg before I reconsider.
				<</if>>
				"<br><br>
                <<He>> leaves the kitchen.
				<<tending_pick $phase 1 1>>
				<br><br>
				<<icon "avery-kitchen.png">><<link [[Next|Mansion Kitchen]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
			<<else>>
				<<averyKitchenNoExcuse>><br><br><<averyKitchenExit "calm">>
				<br><br>
				<<set $weekly.theft.avery_mansion.Ban to true>>
				<<icon "avery-kitchen.png">><<link [[Next|Mansion Kitchen]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
			<</if>>
		<<case "wild_honeycomb">>
			"Excuse me, you wanted to keep a wild honeycomb in your hidden snack stash?" Avery looks at you in shock.
			<br><br>
			<<if (effectiveTransformationLevel("bear") gte 6)>>
				"I'm a bear<<girl>>," you answer quickly. It seems the explanation is enough, because Avery calms down.
				<br><br>
				"Fair enough,<<if playerBellyVisible() or knowsAboutPregnancy("pc", "Avery")>> probably the fact you are pregnant isn't making it any easier,<</if>> but it's a terrible idea. Do you know how many insects will that attract? Just don't do it. You have honey in the kitchen, don't hide it all around the house.
				<<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>>And clean this mess up before anybody gets injured.<<else>>And be more careful in future.<</if>>"
				<br><br>
				<<averyKitchenExit "calm">>
				<br><br>
				<<icon "avery-kitchen.png">><<link [[Next|Mansion Kitchen]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
			<<else>>
				You struggle to find a suitable explanation, so you just stare back at Avery.<br>
				"Do you have any idea how many insects it would attract?" <<He>> continues. "But you weren't going to stash it anywhere, were you? It can be sold for quite a lot after all." Avery frowns.
				<<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>> Clean this up.<<else>> Don't do it again.<</if>>"<<gstress>><<npcincr Avery rage 1>><<stress 6>><<garage>>
				<br><br>
                <<averyKitchenExit "calm">>
				<br><br>
				<<set $weekly.theft.avery_mansion.Ban to true>>
				<<icon "avery-kitchen.png">><<link [[Next|Mansion Kitchen]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
			<</if>>
		<<default>>
			<<averyKitchenNoExcuse>><br><br><<averyKitchenExit "calm">>
			<br><br>
			<<set $weekly.theft.avery_mansion.Ban to true>>
			<<icon "avery-kitchen.png">><<link [[Next|Mansion Kitchen]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<</switch>>
<<elseif setup.foodstuff[$phase].category is "dish">>
	<<if $averyragerevealed>>
		"Afraid of what I say?" Avery raises <<his>> eyebrow. "I'd much rather you take it directly from the kitchen and not try to hide it.
		<<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>> Now, clean this up.<<else>> Be more careful in future.<</if>>"
	<<else>>
		"If you want <<recipe_name $phase>>, ask instead of skulking about," <<he>> sighs. "Take some properly from the kitchen.
		<<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>> And clean this up first.<<else>> And be more careful in future.<</if>>"
	<</if>>
	<<averyKitchenExit "calm">>
	<br><br>
	<<icon "avery-kitchen.png">><<link [[Next|Mansion Kitchen]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<<elseif setup.foodstuff[$phase].category is "ingredient">>
	<<switch $phase>>
		<<case "red_wine" "white_wine">>
			<<if playerBellyVisible() or knowsAboutPregnancy("pc", "Avery")>>
				"Wait, you wanted to..." Avery starts laughing. "It's not even the good wine I have. But sure, take some if you want. <<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>> Just clean that mess first.<</if>>"
				<<averyKitchenExit "calm">><span class="blue"> You are definitely not drinking it any time soon.</span>
				<br><br>
                <<tending_pick $phase 1 2>>
					<br><br>
					<<icon "avery-kitchen.png">><<link [[Next|Mansion Kitchen]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
			<<else>>
				<<He>> sighs. "I have a collection of much better quality beverages. Those here are for cooking only. <<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>>Just clean things up.<<else>>Just be more careful.<</if>> And put it down."
				<<averyKitchenExit "calm">>
				<br><br>
				<<icon "avery-kitchen.png">><<link [[Next|Mansion Kitchen]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
			<</if>>
		<<case "salt" "black_pepper">>
			"You wanted to stash <<recipe_name $phase>>? What else do you have there that needs seasoning?" Avery raises <<his>> eyebrow, but doesn't give you a chance to answer. "Whatever you want to cook, just make it in the kitchen. That's what it's for after all.<<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>> And clean this up first.<<else>> And be more careful in future.<</if>>"
			<<averyKitchenExit "calm">>
			<br><br>
			<<icon "avery-kitchen.png">><<link [[Next|Mansion Kitchen]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
		<<case "pork" "beef">>
			<<if ((effectiveTransformationLevel("wolf") gte 6) or (effectiveTransformationLevel("bird") gte 6) or (effectiveTransformationLevel("cat") gte 6) or (effectiveTransformationLevel("bear") gte 6) or (effectiveTransformationLevel("fox") gte 6))>>
				"Raw <<recipe_name $phase>>? Seriously?"<br>
				<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
					"I'm a <<if (effectiveTransformationLevel("cat") gte 6)>>cat<<girl>><<elseif (effectiveTransformationLevel("wolf") gte 6)>>wolf<<girl>><<elseif (effectiveTransformationLevel("bear") gte 6)>>bear<<girl>><<elseif (effectiveTransformationLevel("fox") gte 6)>>fox<<girl>><<elseif (effectiveTransformationLevel("bird") gte 6)>>harpy<</if>>. Raw meat actually makes me happy."<br>
				<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
					"I'm a <<if (effectiveTransformationLevel("cat") gte 6)>>cat<<girl>><<elseif (effectiveTransformationLevel("wolf") gte 6)>>wolf<<girl>><<elseif (effectiveTransformationLevel("bear") gte 6)>>bear<<girl>><<elseif (effectiveTransformationLevel("fox") gte 6)>>fox<<girl>><<elseif (effectiveTransformationLevel("bird") gte 6)>>harpy<</if>>, what did you expect? I'm a carnivore, I need meat."<br>
				<<else>>
					"I'm a <<if (effectiveTransformationLevel("cat") gte 6)>>cat<<girl>><<elseif (effectiveTransformationLevel("wolf") gte 6)>>wolf<<girl>><<elseif (effectiveTransformationLevel("bear") gte 6)>>bear<<girl>><<elseif (effectiveTransformationLevel("fox") gte 6)>>fox<<girl>><<elseif (effectiveTransformationLevel("bird") gte 6)>>harpy<</if>>. And it means I'm sort of a half-carnivore. I need meat. It makes me happy."<br>
				<</if>>
				"Fair enough," <<he>> sighs. "It stays in the fridge, so it doesn't go bad. If you want to eat it, do it directly from here."<br>
				<<averyKitchenExit "calm">><<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>> Avery didn't mention it, but you probably still have to clean that kitchen.<</if>>
				<br><br>
				<<icon "avery-kitchen.png">><<link [[Next|Mansion Kitchen]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
			<<else>>
				<<if (effectiveTransformationLevel("cow") gte 6) and $phase is "pork">>"How ironic."<<else>>"Is it a joke?<</if>>
                So you wanted to eat raw <<recipe_name $phase>>? Seriously?"
				<<averyKitchenNoExcuse>><br><br><<averyKitchenExit "calm">>
				<<set $weekly.theft.avery_mansion.Ban to true>>
				<br><br>
				<<icon "avery-kitchen.png">><<link [[Next|Mansion Kitchen]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
			<</if>>
		<<default>>
			"You wanted to stash <<recipe_name $phase>> for later? Is it a joke?"
			<<averyKitchenNoExcuse>><br><br><<averyKitchenExit "calm">>
			<br><br>
			<<set $weekly.theft.avery_mansion.Ban to true>>
			<<icon "avery-kitchen.png">><<link [[Next|Mansion Kitchen]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<</switch>>
<<elseif setup.foodstuff[$phase].category is "flower">>
	"Excuse me, you wanted to... eat... this?" Avery looks confused at the flower. "When did it even appear in my kitchen? Take them."<br>
	Avery leaves the kitchen without another word, but as you try to take the <<recipe_name $phase>>, you realize it's missing. <span class="red">It wasn't supposed to happen.<br>(This is a bug, Avery shouldn't be able to stock flowers in the fridge!)</span>
<<else>>
	"You hid <<recipe_name $phase>> for later and expected that to sound normal?"
	<<averyKitchenNoExcuse>><br><br><<averyKitchenExit "calm">>
	<br><br>
	<<set $weekly.theft.avery_mansion.Ban to true>>
	<<icon "avery-kitchen.png">><<link [[Next|Mansion Kitchen]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: Mansion Steal Stash Rage
<<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<set $avery_passage to $passage>><<set $outside to 0>><<effects>><<avery_mansion>>
<<speechresolve>>
<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
	"I was making a stash," you say, shrinking under Avery's stare. "I know, I should have asked."
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
	"I thought I could keep a few things aside," you say, trying to sound composed. The broken glass ruins the attempt.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	"I was hiding it for later," you say. "I'll put it back. I'll clean everything."
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
	"It was for my stash," you say. "You've found it. Congratulations."
<<else>>
	"I was making a stash," you say. Avery's expression makes the excuse feel smaller by the second.
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<if setup.foodstuff[$phase].category is "fruit" or setup.foodstuff[$phase].category is "vegetable">>
	<<if $phase is "lemon" or $phase is "lime">>
		"<<recipe_name $phase "cap">>? You made this mess to stock up on <<recipe_name $phase>>?" Avery winces at the idea. "Put it down.
		<<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>> And clean up the mess.<<else>> And don't make another mess.<</if>>"
		<<averyKitchenExit "rage">>
		<br><br>
		<<averyKitchenPillConsequence>>
		<br><br>
		<<icon "avery-kitchen.png">><<link [[Next|Mansion Kitchen]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<<elseif $phase is "chilli_pepper">>
		"How very brave of you.<<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>> Clean up this mess and leave the pepper here.<<else>> Leave it here.<</if>> You can burn your throat in the kitchen."
		<<averyKitchenExit "rage">>
		<br><br>
		<<averyKitchenPillConsequence>>
		<br><br>
		<<icon "avery-kitchen.png">><<link [[Next|Mansion Kitchen]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<<elseif $phase is "wheat">>
		<<if (effectiveTransformationLevel("cow") gte 6)>>
			"You want to snack on wheat." Avery raises <<his>> eyebrow. "How very fitting. Still, leave it here.<<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>> And clean up the mess you've made.<</if>>"
		<<else>>
			"You wanted to eat wheat?" <<He>> raises <<his>> eyebrow. "Oh you're not taking it anywhere, put it down this second.<<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>> And clean up the mess you've made.<</if>>"
		<</if>>
		<<averyKitchenExit "rage">>
		<br><br>
		<<averyKitchenPillConsequence>>
		<br><br>
		<<icon "avery-kitchen.png">><<link [[Next|Mansion Kitchen]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<<elseif $phase is "rice">>
		"You wanted to eat uncooked rice?"
		<<if (effectiveTransformationLevel("cow") gte 6)>>
			<br><br>
            You just moo in response and prove your point by putting the grain in your mouth. It's actually not that bad.<<stress -2>><<lstress>>
            <br><br>
			"That's your answer? Did you forget how to speak?" <<He>> sighs. "<<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>>Clean up the mess,<<else>>Don't send anything else across the floor,<</if>>" <<he>> says clearly resigned.<<averyKitchenExit "rage">>
			<br><br>
			<<averyKitchenPillConsequence>>
			<br><br>
			<<icon "avery-kitchen.png">><<link [[Next|Mansion Kitchen]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
		<<else>>
			<<averyKitchenTheftEscalation>>
			<br><br>
			<<set $weekly.theft.avery_mansion.Ban to true>>
			<<link [[Next|Kitchen Steal Fight]]>><<set $fightstart to 1>><</link>>
		<</if>>
	<<elseif $phase is "potato">>
		"You wanted to eat a raw potato?
		<<if playerBellyVisible() or knowsAboutPregnancy("pc", "Avery")>> Is that your pregnancy talking? I swear, you're getting more and more stupid by the hour.<<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>> Put it down and clean up the mess.<<else>> Put it down.<</if>> If you want potatoes, you'll have to cook them."
			<<averyKitchenExit "rage">>
			<br><br>
			<<averyKitchenPillConsequence>>
			<br><br>
			<<icon "avery-kitchen.png">><<link [[Next|Mansion Kitchen]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
		<<else>>
			<<averyKitchenTheftEscalation>>
			<br><br>
			<<set $weekly.theft.avery_mansion.Ban to true>>
			<<link [[Next|Kitchen Steal Fight]]>><<set $fightstart to 1>><</link>>
		<</if>>
	<<elseif $phase is "onion">>
		"And what next? You'd just bite into <<recipe_name $phase "article">> as if it were an apple?" Avery raises <<his>> eyebrow at the idea. <<if playerBellyVisible() or knowsAboutPregnancy("pc", "Avery")>>"So that's what you're like when pregnant.<<else>>"At least prepare it.<</if>> Put it down.
		<<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>> And clean up the mess you've made.<<else>> and don't make another mess.<</if>>"
		<<averyKitchenExit "rage">>
		<br><br>
		<<averyKitchenPillConsequence>>
		<br><br>
		<<icon "avery-kitchen.png">><<link [[Next|Mansion Kitchen]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<<elseif $phase is "garlic_bulb">>
		"Raw garlic? Don't." Avery sighs. <<if playerBellyVisible() or knowsAboutPregnancy("pc", "Avery")>>"So that's what you're like when pregnant.<<else>><</if>>
		<<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>> Clean up the mess you've made.<<else>> Don't break anything more.<</if>>"
		<<averyKitchenExit "rage">>
		<br><br>
		<<averyKitchenPillConsequence>>
		<br><br>
		<<icon "avery-kitchen.png">><<link [[Next|Mansion Kitchen]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<<elseif $phase is "wild_carrot" and (effectiveTransformationLevel("bunny") gte 6)>>
		"How fitting. You can take some, but <<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>>clean that mess first.<<else>>don't make another mess.<</if>>"
		<<averyKitchenExit "rage">><<tending_pick $phase 2 3>>
		<br><br>
		<<averyKitchenPillConsequence>>
		<br><br>
		<<icon "avery-kitchen.png">><<link [[Next|Mansion Kitchen]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<<else>>
		"Use the kitchen instead of hiding it.
		<<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>> And clean this up first.<<else>> And try not to send anything else crashing to the floor.<</if>>"
		<<averyKitchenExit "rage">>
		<br><br>
		<<averyKitchenPillConsequence>>
		<br><br>
		<<icon "avery-kitchen.png">><<link [[Next|Mansion Kitchen]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<</if>>
<<elseif setup.foodstuff[$phase].category is "mushroom">>
	"The <<recipe_name $phase>> stays here. Go through the kitchen properly.
	<<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>> And clean this up first.<<else>> And keep the rest of the shelves standing.<</if>>"
	<<averyKitchenExit "rage">>
	<br><br>
	<<averyKitchenPillConsequence>>
	<br><br>
	<<icon "avery-kitchen.png">><<link [[Next|Mansion Kitchen]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<<elseif setup.foodstuff[$phase].category is "produce">>
	<<switch $phase>>
		<<case "bottle_of_milk">>
			"And your plan was to drink it neat?" <<He>> raises <<his>> eyebrow.
			<<if (effectiveTransformationLevel("cat") gte 6)>>
				"I suppose it's logical. But you should care about your figure more. Put it down.
				<<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>> Clean this up.<<else>> Be more careful in future.<</if>>"
			<<else>>
				<br>
				"Yes, pretty much."<br>
				"You should care about your figure more. Put it down.
				<<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>>Clean this up.<<else>>Be more careful in future.<</if>>"
