			<br><br>
			<<averyKitchenPillConsequence>>
			<br><br>
			<<icon "avery-kitchen.png">><<link [[Next|Mansion Kitchen]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
		<<case "cream">>
			"You aren't taking any of it. You should care about your figure more. Put it down.
			<<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>> Clean this up.<<else>> Be more careful in future.<</if>>"
			<<averyKitchenExit "rage">>
			<br><br>
			<<averyKitchenPillConsequence>>
			<br><br>
			<<icon "avery-kitchen.png">><<link [[Next|Mansion Kitchen]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
		<<case "bird_egg">>
			"You wanted to snack on a raw egg?"
            <br><br>
			<<if (effectiveTransformationLevel("fox") gte 6)>>
				"I'm a fox<<girl>>, it's my natural need to bury eggs."
                <br><br>
				<<if Transformations.partActive("fox", "ears")>>"I know, I'm not blind,"<<else>>"I know, I'm not stupid,"<</if>> <<he>> barks. "I just thought you'd at least try to hide the fact that you made such a mess over something so stupid.
				<<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>>
					Clean it up. 
				<<else>>
					Don't do it in the future. 
				<</if>>
				And put the egg down, you aren't burying shit." <<averyKitchenExit "rage">><<if $avery_mansion.schedule is "dinner">> The kitchen can wait. Avery cannot, apparently.<</if>>
				<br><br>
				<<averyKitchenPillConsequence>>
				<br><br>
				<<icon "avery-kitchen.png">><<link [[Next|Mansion Kitchen]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
			<<else>>
				<<averyKitchenTheftEscalation>>
				<br><br>
				<<set $weekly.theft.avery_mansion.Ban to true>>
				<<link [[Next|Kitchen Steal Fight]]>><<set $fightstart to 1>><</link>>
			<</if>>
		<<case "wild_honeycomb">>
			"You wanted to keep a wild honeycomb in your hidden snack stash?" Avery stares at you.
			<br><br>
			<<if (effectiveTransformationLevel("bear") gte 6)>>
				"I'm a bear<<girl>>," you answer, as if that should settle the matter. Avery looks irritated, but less ready to argue.
				<br><br>
				"This is disgusting. Just make honey with it.<<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>> And clean it up.<</if>>" <<averyKitchenExit "rage">>
				<br><br>
				<<averyKitchenPillConsequence>>
				<br><br>
				<<icon "avery-kitchen.png">><<link [[Next|Mansion Kitchen]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
			<<else>>
				<<averyKitchenTheftEscalation>>
				<br><br>
				<<set $weekly.theft.avery_mansion.Ban to true>>
				<<link [[Next|Kitchen Steal Fight]]>><<set $fightstart to 1>><</link>>
			<</if>>
		<<default>>
			<<averyKitchenTheftEscalation>>
			<br><br>
			<<set $weekly.theft.avery_mansion.Ban to true>>
			<<link [[Next|Kitchen Steal Fight]]>><<set $fightstart to 1>><</link>>
	<</switch>>
<<elseif setup.foodstuff[$phase].category is "dish">>
	"Afraid of what I say, huh?" Avery raises <<his>> eyebrow.  "Stop sneaking and take it from the kitchen.
	<<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>> And clean this up first.<<else>> And do not turn the floor into a second pantry.<</if>>"
	<<averyKitchenExit "rage">>
	<br><br>
	<<averyKitchenPillConsequence>>
	<br><br>
	<<icon "avery-kitchen.png">><<link [[Next|Mansion Kitchen]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<<elseif setup.foodstuff[$phase].category is "ingredient">>
	<<switch $phase>>
		<<case "red_wine" "white_wine">>
			"Who said you can drink it? Put it down.<<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>> And clean up the mess you've made.<<else>> And don't make another mess.<</if>>
			<<averyKitchenExit "rage">>
			<br><br>
			<<averyKitchenPillConsequence>>
			<br><br>
			<<icon "avery-kitchen.png">><<link [[Next|Mansion Kitchen]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
		<<case "salt" "black_pepper">>
			"You wanted to stash <<recipe_name $phase>>? What else do you have there that needs seasoning?" Avery raises <<his>> eyebrow, but doesn't give you a chance to answer. "Whatever you want to cook, just make it in the kitchen. That's what it's for after all.<<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>> And clean this up first.<<else>> And don't make another mess.<</if>>"
			<<averyKitchenExit "rage">>
			<br><br>
			<<averyKitchenPillConsequence>>
			<br><br>
			<<icon "avery-kitchen.png">><<link [[Next|Mansion Kitchen]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
		<<case "pork" "beef">>
			<<if ((effectiveTransformationLevel("wolf") gte 6) or (effectiveTransformationLevel("bird") gte 6) or (effectiveTransformationLevel("cat") gte 6) or (effectiveTransformationLevel("bear") gte 6) or (effectiveTransformationLevel("fox") gte 6))>>
				"You were going to eat raw <<recipe_name $phase>>?"
                <br><br>
				<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
					"I'm a <<if (effectiveTransformationLevel("cat") gte 6)>>cat<<girl>><<elseif (effectiveTransformationLevel("wolf") gte 6)>>wolf<<girl>><<elseif (effectiveTransformationLevel("bear") gte 6)>>bear<<girl>><<elseif (effectiveTransformationLevel("fox") gte 6)>>fox<<girl>><<elseif (effectiveTransformationLevel("bird") gte 6)>>harpy<</if>>. Raw meat smells like food to me, not a mistake."<br>
				<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
					"I'm a <<if (effectiveTransformationLevel("cat") gte 6)>>cat<<girl>><<elseif (effectiveTransformationLevel("wolf") gte 6)>>wolf<<girl>><<elseif (effectiveTransformationLevel("bear") gte 6)>>bear<<girl>><<elseif (effectiveTransformationLevel("fox") gte 6)>>fox<<girl>><<elseif (effectiveTransformationLevel("bird") gte 6)>>harpy<</if>>, what did you expect? My teeth are not decorative."<br>
				<<else>>
					"I'm a <<if (effectiveTransformationLevel("cat") gte 6)>>cat<<girl>><<elseif (effectiveTransformationLevel("wolf") gte 6)>>wolf<<girl>><<elseif (effectiveTransformationLevel("bear") gte 6)>>bear<<girl>><<elseif (effectiveTransformationLevel("fox") gte 6)>>fox<<girl>><<elseif (effectiveTransformationLevel("bird") gte 6)>>harpy<</if>>. That comes with cravings. Raw meat is one of the less polite ones."<br>
				<</if>>
                <br>
				"It still stays in the fridge. If you want to eat it, do it directly from here," Avery snaps.
				<br><br>
				<<set $weekly.theft.avery_mansion.Ban to true>>
				<<link [[Next|Kitchen Steal Fight]]>><<set $fightstart to 1>><</link>>
			<<else>>
				<<if (effectiveTransformationLevel("cow") gte 6) and $phase is "pork">>"How ironic."<<else>>"Is it a joke?<</if>> So you wanted to eat raw <<recipe_name $phase>>? Seriously?"
				<<averyKitchenTheftEscalation>>
				<br><br>
				<<set $weekly.theft.avery_mansion.Ban to true>>
				<<link [[Next|Kitchen Steal Fight]]>><<set $fightstart to 1>><</link>>
			<</if>>
		<<default>>
			"That was your clever plan? Hide <<recipe_name $phase>> for later?"
			<<averyKitchenTheftEscalation>>
			<br><br>
			<<set $weekly.theft.avery_mansion.Ban to true>>
			<<link [[Next|Kitchen Steal Fight]]>><<set $fightstart to 1>><</link>>
	<</switch>>
<<elseif setup.foodstuff[$phase].category is "flower">>
	"You wanted to... eat... this?" Avery looks confused at the flower. "When did it even appear in my kitchen? Take them."
    <br><br>
	Avery walks out before the question can get stranger. When you reach for the <<recipe_name $phase>>, it is gone. <span class="red">It wasn't supposed to happen</span>.<i>(This is a bug, Avery shouldn't be able to stock flowers in the fridge!)</i>
    <br><br>
    <<icon "avery-kitchen.png">><<link [[Next|Mansion Kitchen]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<<else>>
	"You thought stashing <<recipe_name $phase>> would make this look better?"
	<<averyKitchenTheftEscalation>>
	<br><br>
	<<set $weekly.theft.avery_mansion.Ban to true>>
	<<link [[Next|Kitchen Steal Fight]]>><<set $fightstart to 1>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: Mansion Steal Snack Calm
<<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<set $avery_passage to $passage>><<set $outside to 0>><<effects>><<avery_mansion>>
<<speechresolve>>
<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
	"I was hungry," you say. "Then the jar slipped. I'm sorry."
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
	"I only wanted something to eat," you say, trying to keep your voice neat despite the mess. "The jar was my fault."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	"I wanted a snack," you say. "I'll clean it up."
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
	"I was getting food," you say. "The jar picked a bad time to fall."
<<else>>
	"I wanted a snack," you say. "The jar fell before I could catch it."
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<if setup.foodstuff[$phase].category is "fruit" or setup.foodstuff[$phase].category is "vegetable">>
	<<if $phase is "lemon" or $phase is "lime">>
		Avery looks from the broken jar to the citrus in your hand. "All that because you wanted to chew on <<recipe_name $phase "article">>?" <<He>> grimaces. <<if playerBellyVisible() or knowsAboutPregnancy("pc", "Avery")>>"Your cravings are getting stranger.<<else>>"At least cut it up properly first.<</if>>
		<<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>>Clean the glass before anyone steps in it.<<else>>Try not to turn a snack into a kitchen accident next time.<</if>>"
		<br><br>
		<<averyKitchenExit "calm">>You decide to still take some.<<tending_pick $phase 2 4>>
	<<elseif $phase is "chilli_pepper">>
