:: Mansion Steal Snack Rage
<<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<set $avery_passage to $passage>><<set $outside to 0>><<effects>><<avery_mansion>>
<<speechresolve>>
<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
	"I-I was hungry," you say, flinching at Avery's tone. "I didn't mean to break anything."
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
	"I was only getting something to eat," you say. The politeness comes out brittle. "The jar slipped."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	"I wanted a snack," you say. "I'll put it back. I'll clean it."
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
	"I wanted food," you say. "The jar fell. That's all."
<<else>>
	"I wanted a snack," you say, though Avery's face tells you the excuse is already failing.
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<if setup.foodstuff[$phase].category is "fruit" or setup.foodstuff[$phase].category is "vegetable">>
	<<if $phase is "lemon" or $phase is "lime">>
		"<<recipe_name $phase "cap">>? You made this mess to snack on <<recipe_name $phase>>?" Avery winces at the idea. "<<if playerBellyVisible() or knowsAboutPregnancy("pc", "Avery")>>So that's what your cravings are.<<else>>At least put some sugar on it.<</if>>
		<<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>>Still, clean this up first.<<else>>Still, be more careful in future.<</if>>"
		<br><br>
		<<averyKitchenExit "rage">>You decide to still take some.<<tending_pick $phase 2 4>>
		<br><br>
		<<averyKitchenPillConsequence>>
		<br><br>
		<<icon "avery-kitchen.png">><<link [[Next|Mansion Kitchen]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<<elseif $phase is "chilli_pepper">>
		"A chilli pepper." Avery's voice goes flat. "You are either lying, or you thought this was worth testing me over.<<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>> Clean up this mess and leave it here.<<else>> Leave it here.<</if>> Burn your throat some other time."
		<br><br>
		<<averyKitchenExit "rage">><<averyKitchenPillConsequence>>
		<br><br>
		<<icon "avery-kitchen.png">><<link [[Next|Mansion Kitchen]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<<elseif $phase is "wheat">>
		<<if (effectiveTransformationLevel("cow") gte 6)>>
			Avery looks at the wheat, then at you. "That almost suits you. It still stays here.<<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>> Clean up the mess you've made.<</if>>"
		<<else>>
			"You broke a jar over wheat?" <<He>> asks. "No. Put it down before this gets even more ridiculous.<<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>> Then clean up the mess you've made.<</if>>"
		<</if>>
		<<averyKitchenExit "rage">>
		<br><br>
		<<averyKitchenPillConsequence>>
		<br><br>
		<<icon "avery-kitchen.png">><<link [[Next|Mansion Kitchen]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<<elseif $phase is "rice">>
		"Dry rice was worth this?"
		<br><br>
		<<if (effectiveTransformationLevel("cow") gte 6)>>
			You moo back at <<him>>, then put the grain in your mouth as proof. It is not as awful as it looks.<<stress -2>><<lstress>>
			<br><br>
			"That's your answer? Did you forget how to speak?" <<He>> sighs. "<<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>>Clean up the mess,<<else>>Don't send anything else across the floor,<</if>>" <<he>> says clearly resigned.
			<br><br>
			<<averyKitchenExit "rage">><<averyKitchenPillConsequence>>
			<br><br>
			<<icon "avery-kitchen.png">><<link [[Next|Mansion Kitchen]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
		<<else>>
			<<averyKitchenTheftEscalation>>
			<br><br>
			<<set $weekly.theft.avery_mansion.Ban to true>>
			<<link [[Next|Kitchen Steal Fight]]>><<set $fightstart to 1>><</link>>
		<</if>>
	<<elseif $phase is "potato">>
		"A raw potato. Stupid excuse.
		<<if playerBellyVisible() or knowsAboutPregnancy("pc", "Avery")>>Pregnancy cravings do not make this less absurd.<<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>> Put it down and clean up the mess.<<else>> Put it down.<</if>> If you want potatoes, cook them."
			<br><br>
			<<averyKitchenExit "rage">><<averyKitchenPillConsequence>>
			<br><br>
			<<icon "avery-kitchen.png">><<link [[Next|Mansion Kitchen]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
		<<else>>
			What is the real reason for this?"<<averyKitchenTheftEscalation>>
			<br><br>
			<<set $weekly.theft.avery_mansion.Ban to true>>
			<<link [[Next|Kitchen Steal Fight]]>><<set $fightstart to 1>><</link>>
		<</if>>
	<<elseif $phase is "onion">>
		Avery's stare drops to the <<recipe_name $phase>>. "Were you planning to bite into that in front of me? <<if playerBellyVisible() or knowsAboutPregnancy("pc", "Avery")>>Your cravings are not an excuse to act feral.<<else>>Prepare it like a person.<</if>> Put it down.
		<<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>>And clean up the mess you've made.<<else>>And do not make another mess.<</if>>"
		<br><br>
		<<averyKitchenExit "rage">><<averyKitchenPillConsequence>>
		<br><br>
		<<icon "avery-kitchen.png">><<link [[Next|Mansion Kitchen]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<<elseif $phase is "garlic_bulb">>
		"Do not make me watch you bite raw garlic," Avery says. "<<if playerBellyVisible() or knowsAboutPregnancy("pc", "Avery")>>I do not care what your cravings are saying.<</if>>
		<<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>>Clean up the mess you've made.<<else>>Do not break anything more.<</if>>"
		<br><br>
		<<averyKitchenExit "rage">><<averyKitchenPillConsequence>>
		<br><br>
		<<icon "avery-kitchen.png">><<link [[Next|Mansion Kitchen]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<<elseif $phase is "wild_carrot" and (effectiveTransformationLevel("bunny") gte 6)>>
		"How fitting. Take some, but <<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>>clean that mess first.<<else>>don't make another mess.<</if>>"
		<<averyKitchenExit "rage">><<tending_pick $phase 1 2>>
		<br><br>
		<<averyKitchenPillConsequence>>
		<br><br>
		<<icon "avery-kitchen.png">><<link [[Next|Mansion Kitchen]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<<else>>
		"Fair enough,
		<<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>>but clean this up first.<<else>>but try not to send anything else crashing to the floor.<</if>>"
		<<averyKitchenExit "rage">><<tending_pick $phase 1 1>>
		<br><br>
		<<averyKitchenPillConsequence>>
		<br><br>
		<<icon "avery-kitchen.png">><<link [[Next|Mansion Kitchen]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<</if>>
<<elseif setup.foodstuff[$phase].category is "mushroom">>
	"The <<recipe_name $phase>> stays here. Pick something else to snack on.
	<<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>>And clean this up first.<<else>>And do not make me hear another crash.<</if>>"
	<<averyKitchenExit "rage">>
	<br><br>
	<<averyKitchenPillConsequence>>
	<br><br>
	<<icon "avery-kitchen.png">><<link [[Next|Mansion Kitchen]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<<elseif setup.foodstuff[$phase].category is "produce">>
	<<switch $phase>>
		<<case "bottle_of_milk">>
			"You want to drink a whole bottle of milk?" <<He>> raises <<his>> eyebrow. 
			<<if (effectiveTransformationLevel("cat") gte 6)>>
				"I suppose it is logical, but you still do not help yourself while I am standing here.
				<<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>>Clean this up.<<else>> Be more careful in future.<</if>>"
			<<else>>
				"You are not drinking from my kitchen stores like a stray.
				<<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>>Clean this up.<<else>>Be more careful in future.<</if>>"
			<</if>>
			<<averyKitchenExit "rage">>
			<br><br>
			<<averyKitchenPillConsequence>>
			<br><br>
			<<icon "avery-kitchen.png">><<link [[Next|Mansion Kitchen]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
		<<case "cream">>
			"You are not spooning cream out of the kitchen because you got peckish. 
			<<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>>Put it down.<<else>>Be more careful in future.<</if>>"
			<<averyKitchenExit "rage">>
			<br><br>
			<<averyKitchenPillConsequence>>
			<br><br>
			<<icon "avery-kitchen.png">><<link [[Next|Mansion Kitchen]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
		<<case "bird_egg">>
			"You wanted to snack on a raw egg? No, you don't."
			<<averyKitchenTheftEscalation>>
			<br><br>
			<<set $weekly.theft.avery_mansion.Ban to true>>
			<<link [[Next|Kitchen Steal Fight]]>><<set $fightstart to 1>><</link>>
		<<case "wild_honeycomb">>
			Avery stares at the honeycomb like it personally offended <<him>>. "That was supposed to be your snack?"
            <br><br>
			<<if (effectiveTransformationLevel("bear") gte 6)>>
				"I'm a bear<<girl>>," you answer before <<he>> can accuse you again. Avery accepts it with a strained sigh.
                <br><br>
				"Chew it somewhere else, then. Preferably after turning it into honey like a sensible person.<<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>> And clean it up.<</if>>"
				<<averyKitchenExit "rage">>
				<br><br>
				<<averyKitchenPillConsequence>>
				<br><br>
				<<icon "avery-kitchen.png">><<link [[Next|Mansion Kitchen]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
			<<else>>
				<<averyKitchenTheftEscalation>>
				<br><br>
				<<set $weekly.theft.avery_mansion.Ban to true>>
				<<link [[Next|Kitchen Steal Fight]]>><<set $fightstart to 1>><</link>>
			<</if>>
		<<default>>
			<<averyKitchenTheftEscalation>>
			<br><br>
			<<set $weekly.theft.avery_mansion.Ban to true>>
			<<link [[Next|Kitchen Steal Fight]]>><<set $fightstart to 1>><</link>>
	<</switch>>
<<elseif setup.foodstuff[$phase].category is "dish">>
	"Afraid of what I say, huh?" Avery raises <<his>> eyebrow. "Fine, eat it,
	<<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>>but clean this up first.<<else>>but try not to send anything else crashing to the floor.<</if>>"
	<<averyKitchenExit "rage">><<tending_pick $phase 1 1>>
	<br><br>
	<<averyKitchenPillConsequence>>
	<br><br>
	<<icon "avery-kitchen.png">><<link [[Next|Mansion Kitchen]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<<elseif setup.foodstuff[$phase].category is "ingredient">>
	<<switch $phase>>
		<<case "red_wine" "white_wine">>
			"You do not get to turn my cooking wine into a stolen drink. Put it down.<<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>> And clean up the mess you've made.<<else>> And don't make another mess.<</if>>"
			<<averyKitchenExit "rage">>
			<br><br>
			<<averyKitchenPillConsequence>>
			<br><br>
			<<icon "avery-kitchen.png">><<link [[Next|Mansion Kitchen]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
		<<case "pork" "beef">>
			<<if ((effectiveTransformationLevel("wolf") gte 6) or (effectiveTransformationLevel("bird") gte 6) or (effectiveTransformationLevel("cat") gte 6) or (effectiveTransformationLevel("bear") gte 6) or (effectiveTransformationLevel("fox") gte 6))>>
				"You saw raw <<recipe_name $phase>> and thought that was worth stealing?"
                <br><br>
				<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
					"I'm a <<if (effectiveTransformationLevel("cat") gte 6)>>cat<<girl>><<elseif (effectiveTransformationLevel("wolf") gte 6)>>wolf<<girl>><<elseif (effectiveTransformationLevel("bear") gte 6)>>bear<<girl>><<elseif (effectiveTransformationLevel("fox") gte 6)>>fox<<girl>><<elseif (effectiveTransformationLevel("bird") gte 6)>>harpy<</if>>. It is not pretty, but it settles the craving."<br>
				<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
					"I'm a <<if (effectiveTransformationLevel("cat") gte 6)>>cat<<girl>><<elseif (effectiveTransformationLevel("wolf") gte 6)>>wolf<<girl>><<elseif (effectiveTransformationLevel("bear") gte 6)>>bear<<girl>><<elseif (effectiveTransformationLevel("fox") gte 6)>>fox<<girl>><<elseif (effectiveTransformationLevel("bird") gte 6)>>harpy<</if>>, what did you expect? This is practically instinct."<br>
				<<else>>
					"I'm a <<if (effectiveTransformationLevel("cat") gte 6)>>cat<<girl>><<elseif (effectiveTransformationLevel("wolf") gte 6)>>wolf<<girl>><<elseif (effectiveTransformationLevel("bear") gte 6)>>bear<<girl>><<elseif (effectiveTransformationLevel("fox") gte 6)>>fox<<girl>><<elseif (effectiveTransformationLevel("bird") gte 6)>>harpy<</if>>. I know it looks strange. It still feels like food to me."<br>
				<</if>>
                <br>
				"Fine. Take one... from me, directly."
                <br><br>
				<<set $weekly.theft.avery_mansion.Ban to true>>
				<<link [[Next|Kitchen Steal Fight]]>><<set $fightstart to 1>><</link>>
			<<else>>
				<<if (effectiveTransformationLevel("cow") gte 6) and $phase is "pork">>"How ironic."<<else>>"Is it a joke?<</if>> So you wanted to eat raw <<recipe_name $phase>>? Seriously?"
				<<averyKitchenTheftEscalation>>
				<br><br>
				<<set $weekly.theft.avery_mansion.Ban to true>>
				<<link [[Next|Kitchen Steal Fight]]>><<set $fightstart to 1>><</link>>
			<</if>>
		<<default>>
			"You grabbed <<recipe_name $phase "article">> and called it a snack? Try again."
			<<averyKitchenTheftEscalation>>
			<br><br>
			<<set $weekly.theft.avery_mansion.Ban to true>>
			<<link [[Next|Kitchen Steal Fight]]>><<set $fightstart to 1>><</link>>
	<</switch>>
<<elseif setup.foodstuff[$phase].category is "flower">>
	Avery looks from you to the flower, baffled. "You planned to eat this? Why is it even in my kitchen? Fine, take it."
    <br><br>
	Avery leaves before you can answer. When you reach for the <<recipe_name $phase>>, there is nothing there.
    <br><br>
    <span class="red">It wasn't supposed to happen.</span><i>(This is a bug, Avery shouldn't be able to stock flowers in the fridge!)</i>
	<<link [[Next|Mansion Kitchen]]>><</link>>
<<else>>
	"You call that a snack? No. That is you being caught and picking the first word that sounded harmless."
	<<averyKitchenTheftEscalation>>
	<br><br>
	<<set $weekly.theft.avery_mansion.Ban to true>>
	<<link [[Next|Kitchen Steal Fight]]>><<set $fightstart to 1>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: Avery Kitchen Steal
<<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<set $avery_passage to $passage>><<set $outside to 0>><<effects>><<avery_mansion>>
<<set $weekly.theft to $weekly.theft || {}>><<set $weekly.theft.avery_mansion to $weekly.theft.avery_mansion || {}>>
<<if $weekly.theft.avery_mansion.Ban is undefined>><<set $weekly.theft.avery_mansion.Ban to false>><</if>>
You look through the cabinets and check the fridge.
<br><br>
<<if $avery_mansion.schedule is "away" or $avery_mansion.schedule is "work">>
	<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 200>>
	Avery isn't home, so as long as you don't make a mess, <<nnpc_he "Avery">> shouldn't find out.
<<elseif $avery_mansion.schedule is "dinner">>
	<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 400>>
	Avery is in the dining room. <<nnpc_He "Avery">> shouldn't suspect you of doing anything unless you act suspiciously.
<<else>>
	<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 300>>
	Avery isn't anywhere close, so as long as you don't make a mess, <<nnpc_he "Avery">> shouldn't find out.
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<if $weekly.theft.avery_mansion.Ban>>
	<<if $averyragerevealed is 1 or C.npc.Avery.rage gte 40>>
		Avery is still too wound up about the last mess. <span class="blue">Stealing from <<nnpc_his "Avery">> kitchen again this week would only push <<nnpc_him "Avery">> further</span>, so you keep your hands to yourself for now.
		<br><br>
	<<else>>
		Avery noticed enough already. <span class="blue">Trying to steal from <<nnpc_his "Avery">> kitchen again this week would only make <<nnpc_him "Avery">> angrier</span>, so you leave the cupboards alone for now.
		<br><br>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	<<set _averyKitchenStockNormal to ($avery_mansion.kitchen_stock && Array.isArray($avery_mansion.kitchen_stock.normal)) ? $avery_mansion.kitchen_stock.normal : Array()>>
	<<set _averyKitchenStockRequested to ($avery_mansion.kitchen_stock && Array.isArray($avery_mansion.kitchen_stock.requested)) ? $avery_mansion.kitchen_stock.requested : Array()>>
	<<set _averyKitchenStockAll to _averyKitchenStockNormal.concat(_averyKitchenStockRequested)>>
	<<ingredientsSuppliesSteal _averyKitchenStockAll>>
<</if>>
<<icon "avery-kitchen.png">><<link [[Go Back|Mansion Kitchen]]>><</link>>

:: avery_mansion Kitchen Steal Result
<<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<set $avery_passage to $passage>><<set $outside to 0>><<effects>><<avery_mansion>>
<<set _housekeeping_time to 2*Math.floor(10 - $housekeeping / 200)>>	
<<set _averyJobs to Array.isArray($avery_mansion.jobs) ? $avery_mansion.jobs : Array()>>
<<set _averyFoodKey to $avery_mansion.food>>
<<set _averyFoodRecipe to _averyFoodKey && setup.foodstuff && setup.foodstuff[_averyFoodKey] && setup.foodstuff[_averyFoodKey].recipe>>
<<set _averyFoodIngredients to (_averyFoodRecipe && Array.isArray(_averyFoodRecipe.ingredients)) ? _averyFoodRecipe.ingredients.slice() : (($avery_mansion.food && Array.isArray($avery_mansion.food.ingredients)) ? $avery_mansion.food.ingredients.slice() : Array())>>
<<run _averyFoodIngredients.forEach(function (ingredient) { const alternatives = setup.foodstuff && setup.foodstuff[ingredient] && setup.foodstuff[ingredient].ingredient_alternatives; if (alternatives && Array.isArray(alternatives.normal)) alternatives.normal.forEach(function (alternative) { _averyFoodIngredients.pushUnique(alternative); }); })>>
<<run Object.values((_averyFoodRecipe && _averyFoodRecipe.ingredient_alternatives && _averyFoodRecipe.ingredient_alternatives.normal) || {}).forEach(function (alternatives) { if (Array.isArray(alternatives)) alternatives.forEach(function (alternative) { _averyFoodIngredients.pushUnique(alternative); }); })>>
<<set _averyPhaseMatchesRecipe to _averyFoodIngredients.includes($phase)>>
<<skulduggerycheck "silent">>

<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	You take the <<recipe_name $phase "plural">> from the cupboard.<<tending_pick $phase 3 6>>
	<span class="blue">You probably shouldn't take more</span>, or Avery will realise too much has gone missing.
	<br><br>
	<<icon "avery-kitchen.png">><<link [[Walk Away|Mansion Kitchen]]>><</link>>
	<br><br>
	<<set _averyKitchenStockNormal to ($avery_mansion.kitchen_stock && Array.isArray($avery_mansion.kitchen_stock.normal)) ? $avery_mansion.kitchen_stock.normal : Array()>>
	<<set _averyKitchenStockRequested to ($avery_mansion.kitchen_stock && Array.isArray($avery_mansion.kitchen_stock.requested)) ? $avery_mansion.kitchen_stock.requested : Array()>>
	<<set _averyKitchenStockAll to _averyKitchenStockNormal.concat(_averyKitchenStockRequested)>>
	<<ingredientsSuppliesSteal _averyKitchenStockAll>>
<<else>>
	<<avery_housework_change "kitchen" 2>>
	<<npc Avery>><<person1>>
	As you reach for the <<recipe_name $phase "plural">>, your elbow catches a jar near the counter's edge. It drops before you can save it, shattering loudly across the kitchen tiles.
	For a second, the whole room seems to hold its breath.
	<<if $avery_mansion.schedule is "away" or $avery_mansion.schedule is "work">>
		<<if _averyJobs.includes("kitchen")>>
			Avery isn't home to judge you, but you have given yourself another <<print _housekeeping_time>> minutes of cleaning.
			<<pass _housekeeping_time>>
		<<else>>
			Avery isn't home to judge you, but you spend <<print _housekeeping_time>> minutes cleaning it up regardless.
			<<pass _housekeeping_time>>
		<</if>>
		<br><br>
		<<icon "avery-kitchen.png">><<link [[Next|Mansion Kitchen]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<<elseif $avery_mansion.schedule is "dinner">>
		<<if $averyragerevealed is 1 and C.npc.Avery.rage gte random(20, 100)>>
			<br><br>
			"What the fuck was that!?" Avery shouts from the doorway.
			<br><br>
			You jump. <<He>> sounds alarmed, and very much not in the mood for another problem.<<garage>><<npcincr Avery rage 1>><<gstress>><<stress 6>>
			<br><br>
			<<if _averyPhaseMatchesRecipe>>
				"<<recipe_name $phase "cap">>? Is it so much to ask for <<recipe_name $avery_mansion.food "article">> to be ready when I come back home?"
				<<He>> scoffs, annoyed. "Clean up that mess. And hurry up."
				<br><br>
				<<He>> returns to the dining room.
				<<if _averyJobs.includes("kitchen")>>
					You will have to take care of it before <<he>> returns to the kitchen.
				<<else>>
					<<pass _housekeeping_time>>
					You spend <<print _housekeeping_time>> minutes cleaning the mess you've made.
					<<if Time.hour lte 1>>
						When you look up at the clock, you notice it's after midnight. <span class="red">Avery must be pissed.</span>
					<<else>>
						You look up at the clock. <span class="gold">Avery is still waiting for dinner.</span>
					<</if>>
				<</if>>
			<<else>>
				<<if $avery_mansion.rage.dinner_missed gt 0>>
					"<<recipe_name $phase "cap">>? Are you trying to feed me a fucking <<recipe_name $phase>>?"
					<<He>> walks up to you and grasps your arm harshly. "You weren't planning on doing what I asked again, were you? You just take and take from me and give nothing in return!"<<npcincr Avery rage 3>><<ggarage>>
					<br><br>
					<<He>> steps closer and rolls up <<his>> sleeves.<<gtrauma>><<gstress>><<trauma 6>><<stress 6>>
					<<set $weekly.theft.avery_mansion.Ban to true>>
                    <br><br>
					<<link [[Fight|Kitchen Steal Fight]]>><<set $fightstart to 1>><</link>>
				<<elseif $avery_mansion.rage.dinner_wrong>>
					"<<recipe_name $phase "cap">>? So you aren't making <<recipe_name $avery_mansion.food "article">> today?" 
					<<He>> scoffs. "Clean up that mess. And hurry up."
					<br><br>
					<<He>> returns to the dining room.
					<<if _averyJobs.includes("kitchen")>>
						You need to deal with it before <<he>> comes back.
					<<else>>
						<<pass _housekeeping_time>>
						It takes <<print _housekeeping_time>> minutes to clear the worst of the mess.
						<<if Time.hour lte 1>>
							The clock shows past midnight. <span class="red">Avery must be pissed.</span>
						<<else>>
							The clock catches your eye. <span class="gold">Avery is still waiting for dinner.</span>
						<</if>>
					<</if>>
				<<else>>
					"You don't even need <<recipe_name $phase>> for <<recipe_name $avery_mansion.food "article">>, and you're making a mess because of it? Can you not break anything at least once?" 
					<<He>> scoffs. "Clean that up before I lose my patience."
					<br><br>
					<<He>> returns to the dining room.
					<<if _averyJobs.includes("kitchen")>>
						There is no leaving it like this before <<he>> returns.
					<<else>>
						<<pass _housekeeping_time>>
						You lose <<print _housekeeping_time>> minutes putting the kitchen back in order.
						<<if Time.hour lte 1>>
							When you look up at the clock, you notice it's after midnight. <span class="red">Avery must be angry.</span>
						<<else>>
							When you check the time, your stomach drops. <span class="gold">Avery is still waiting for dinner.</span>
						<</if>>
					<</if>>
				<</if>>
			<</if>>
			<br><br>
			<<icon "avery-kitchen.png">><<link [[Next|Mansion Kitchen]]>><<endevent>><</link>>			
		<<else>>
			<br><br>
			"What's happening?" Avery calls from the doorway.
			You turn to see <<him>> at the entrance, one hand still on the frame. The sound has pulled <<him>> out of the dining room, and the mess tells on you before you can say a word.<<gstress>><<stress 2>>
			<<if _averyPhaseMatchesRecipe>>
				<br><br>
				<<His>> expression softens when <<he>> sees you holding <<recipe_name $phase "article">>. "You wanted to make sure the <<recipe_name $avery_mansion.food "article">> would be ready, I take it?
				<<if _averyJobs.includes("kitchen")>>
					Just clean it up after you finish." <<He>> returns to the dining room. You will have to come back to it later. For now, Avery is hungry and angry.
				<<else>>
					Just leave it for the maid to clean. I'll be waiting in the dining room." <<He>> returns to the dining room.
				<</if>>
				<br><br>
				<<icon "avery-kitchen.png">><<link [[Next|Mansion Kitchen]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
			<<else>>
				<<IngredientCheck>>
				<br><br>
				<<He>> sighs when <<he>> notices the mess, then leans against the doorframe. The silence makes it clear that Avery expects an answer, not just an apology.
				"It's not exactly time for culinary experiments right now. Why do you need <<recipe_name $phase "article">>? I don't think it's part of <<recipe_name $avery_mansion.food "article">>."
				<br><br>
				You can feel the excuse forming badly in your throat.
				<br><br>
				<<if random(1, 2) is 2>>
					<<link [[Say you were planning to make <<recipe_name _valid "article">>|Mansion Steal Cooking Valid Calm]]>><<set $phase2 to _valid>><</link>><br>
					<<link [[Say you were planning to make <<recipe_name _unvalid "article">>|Mansion Steal Cooking Calm]]>><<set $phase2 to _unvalid>><</link>><br>
				<<else>>
					<<link [[Say you were planning to make <<recipe_name _unvalid "article">>|Mansion Steal Cooking Calm]]>><<set $phase2 to _unvalid>><</link>><br>
					<<link [[Say you were planning to make <<recipe_name _valid "article">>|Mansion Steal Cooking Valid Calm]]>><<set $phase2 to _valid>><</link>><br>
				<</if>>
				<<link [[Say you wanted to get a snack|Mansion Steal Snack Calm]]>><</link>><br>
				<<link [[Say you wanted to get a hidden food stash|Mansion Steal Stash Calm]]>><</link>><br>
				<<if (effectiveTransformationLevel("fox") gte 6) and $phase is "chicken_egg">>
					<<link [[Say you wanted to bury the egg|Mansion Steal Bury Egg]]>><</link>><br>
				<</if>>
				<<if ($avery_mansion.kitchen_stock && Array.isArray($avery_mansion.kitchen_stock.requested) && $avery_mansion.kitchen_stock.requested.includes($phase)) && $avery_mansion.kitchen_stock.requested.length gte 3>>
					<<link [[Say you wanted to save it for another time|Mansion Steal Save]]>><</link>><br>
				<<else>>
					<<link [[Say you wanted to save it for another time|Mansion Steal Save Fail]]>><</link>><br>
				<</if>>
				<<if $phase is "pork" or $phase is "beef">>
					<<if ((effectiveTransformationLevel("wolf") gte 6) or (effectiveTransformationLevel("bird") gte 6) or (effectiveTransformationLevel("cat") gte 6) or (effectiveTransformationLevel("bear") gte 6) or (effectiveTransformationLevel("fox") gte 6))>>
						<<link [[Say you wanted to eat <<recipe_name $phase "article">>|Mansion Steal Raw]]>><</link>><br>
					<</if>>
					<<if Object.values($children).find(child => child.mother === "pc" && child.location === "wolf_cave")>>
						<<link [[Say you wanted to feed it to a child|Mansion Steal Child]]>><</link>><br>
					<</if>>
					<<if $syndromewolves gte 1>>
						<<link [[Say you wanted to give it to Black Wolf|Mansion Steal Friend]]>><<set $phase2 to "wolf">><</link>><br>
					<</if>>
					<<if $syndromebird gte 1>>
						<<link [[Say you wanted to give it to the Great Hawk|Mansion Steal Friend]]>><<set $phase2 to "bird">><</link>><br>
					<</if>>
				<</if>>
				<<if (effectiveTransformationLevel("bear") gte 6) and $phase is "wild_honeycomb">>
					<<link [[Say you like honey|Mansion Steal Honey]]>><</link>><br>
				<</if>>
				<<link [[Say you're making a surprise|Mansion Steal Surprise]]>><</link>><br>
				<<link [[Make something up|Mansion Steal Dumb]]>><<set $phase2 to _valid>><</link>><br>
				<<link [[Say you wanted to give it to the orphans|Mansion Steal Orphans]]>><</link>><br>
				<<if effectiveTransformationLevel("fox") gte 2 and $phase is "chicken_egg">>
					<<link [[Defend stealing as your natural need|Mansion Steal Fox]]>><</link>><br>
				<<else>>
					<<link [[Admit to stealing|Mansion Steal Admit]]>><</link>><br>
				<</if>>
			<</if>>
		<</if>>
	<<else>>
		<<if $averyragerevealed is 1 and C.npc.Avery.rage gte random(20, 100)>>
			<br><br>
			"What the fuck are you doing!?" Avery shouts from the doorway.
			<br><br>
			You jump. <<He>> sounds alarmed, and very much not in the mood for another problem.
			<<if _averyPhaseMatchesRecipe>>
				<<His>> expression softens only a little when <<he>> sees you holding <<recipe_name $phase "article">>.
				<br><br>
				<<if $avery_mansion.rage.dinner_missed >= 0>>
					"At least this time you're actually making me what I requested. Clean it up."
				<<else>>
					"It's too early to make <<recipe_name $avery_mansion.food "article">>, it will get cold by the evening," <<he>> comments. "Clean it up."
				<</if>>
				<<He>> leaves the kitchen.
				<br><br>
				<<icon "avery-kitchen.png">><<link [[Next|Mansion Kitchen]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
			<<else>>
				<<IngredientCheck>>
				"<<recipe_name $phase>>? What were you doing with it to cause this mess?"
				<br><br>
				<<if random(1, 2) is 2>>
					<<link [[Say you were planning to make <<recipe_name _valid "article">>|Mansion Steal Cooking Valid Rage]]>><<set $phase2 to _valid>><</link>><br>
					<<link [[Say you were planning to make <<recipe_name _unvalid "article">>|Mansion Steal Cooking Rage]]>><<set $phase2 to _unvalid>><</link>><br>
				<<else>>
					<<link [[Say you were planning to make <<recipe_name _unvalid "article">>|Mansion Steal Cooking Rage]]>><<set $phase2 to _unvalid>><</link>><br>
					<<link [[Say you were planning to make <<recipe_name _valid "article">>|Mansion Steal Cooking Valid Rage]]>><<set $phase2 to _valid>><</link>><br>
				<</if>>
				<<link [[Say you wanted to get a snack|Mansion Steal Snack Rage]]>><</link>><br>
				<<link [[Say you wanted to get a hidden food stash|Mansion Steal Stash Rage]]>><</link>><br>
				<<if (effectiveTransformationLevel("fox") gte 6) and $phase is "chicken_egg">>
					<<link [[Say you wanted to bury the egg|Mansion Steal Bury Egg Rage]]>><</link>><br>
				<</if>>
				<<if ($avery_mansion.kitchen_stock && Array.isArray($avery_mansion.kitchen_stock.requested) && $avery_mansion.kitchen_stock.requested.includes($phase)) && $avery_mansion.kitchen_stock.requested.length gte 3>>
					<<link [[Say you wanted to save it for another time|Mansion Steal Save Rage]]>><</link>><br>
				<<else>>
					<<link [[Say you wanted to save it for another time|Mansion Steal Save Rage Fail]]>><</link>><br>
				<</if>>
				<<if $phase is "pork" or $phase is "beef">>
					<<if ((effectiveTransformationLevel("wolf") gte 6) or (effectiveTransformationLevel("bird") gte 6) or (effectiveTransformationLevel("cat") gte 6) or (effectiveTransformationLevel("bear") gte 6) or (effectiveTransformationLevel("fox") gte 6))>>
						<<link [[Say you wanted to eat <<recipe_name $phase "article">>|Mansion Steal Raw]]>><</link>><br>
					<</if>>
					<<if Object.values($children).find(child => child.mother === "pc" && child.location === "wolf_cave")>>
						<<link [[Say you wanted to feed it to a child|Mansion Steal Child Rage]]>><</link>><br>
					<</if>>
					<<if $syndromewolves gte 1>>
						<<link [[Say you wanted to give it to Black Wolf|Mansion Steal Friend Rage]]>><<set $phase2 to "wolf">><</link>><br>
					<</if>>
					<<if $syndromebird gte 1>>
						<<link [[Say you wanted to give it to the Great Hawk|Mansion Steal Friend Rage]]>><<set $phase2 to "bird">><</link>><br>
					<</if>>
				<</if>>
				<<if (effectiveTransformationLevel("bear") gte 6) and $phase is "wild_honeycomb">>
					<<link [[Say you like honey|Mansion Steal Honey Rage]]>><</link>><br>
				<</if>>
				<<link [[Say you're making a surprise|Mansion Steal Surprise Rage]]>><</link>><br>
				<<link [[Make something up|Mansion Steal Dumb Rage]]>><<set $phase2 to _valid>><</link>><br>
				<<link [[Say you wanted to give it to the orphans|Mansion Steal Orphans Rage]]>><</link>><br>
				<<if effectiveTransformationLevel("fox") gte 2 and $phase is "chicken_egg">>
					<<link [[Defend stealing as your natural need|Mansion Steal Fox Rage]]>><</link>><br>
				<<else>>
					<<link [[Admit to stealing|Mansion Steal Admit Rage]]>><</link>><br>
				<</if>>
			<</if>>
		<<else>>
			<br><br>
			"What's happening?" Avery calls from the doorway. 
            <br><br>
            You turn to see <<him>> standing at the entrance, alarmed by the noise.
			<<if _averyPhaseMatchesRecipe>>
				<<His>> expression softens when <<he>> sees you holding <<recipe_name $phase "article">>.
				"Getting a head start on <<recipe_name $avery_mansion.food "article">>, are you?
				<<if _averyJobs.includes("kitchen")>>
					Just clean it up after you finish."
                    <br><br>
					<<He>> returns to the dining room. You will need to return later. Right now, Avery is hungry and angry.
				<<else>>
					Leave it for the maid. I'll be in the dining room." <<He>> turns away before you can argue.
				<</if>>
				<br><br>
				<<icon "avery-kitchen.png">><<link [[Next|Mansion Kitchen]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
			<<else>>
				<<IngredientCheck>>
				<<He>> sighs when <<he>> notices the mess, but looks calm otherwise.
				"Be more careful in future. There are valuable things in here. What were you planning to do with <<recipe_name $phase>>?"
				<br><br>
				<<if random(1, 2) is 2>>
					<<link [[Say you were planning to make <<recipe_name _valid "article">>|Mansion Steal Cooking Valid Calm]]>><<set $phase2 to _valid>><</link>><br>
					<<link [[Say you were planning to make <<recipe_name _unvalid "article">>|Mansion Steal Cooking Calm]]>><<set $phase2 to _unvalid>><</link>><br>
				<<else>>
					<<link [[Say you were planning to make <<recipe_name _unvalid "article">>|Mansion Steal Cooking Calm]]>><<set $phase2 to _unvalid>><</link>><br>
					<<link [[Say you were planning to make <<recipe_name _valid "article">>|Mansion Steal Cooking Valid Calm]]>><<set $phase2 to _valid>><</link>><br>
				<</if>>
				<<link [[Say you wanted to get a snack|Mansion Steal Snack Calm]]>><</link>><br>
				<<link [[Say you wanted to get a hidden food stash|Mansion Steal Stash Calm]]>><</link>><br>
				<<if (effectiveTransformationLevel("fox") gte 6) and $phase is "chicken_egg">>
					<<link [[Say you wanted to bury the egg|Mansion Steal Bury Egg]]>><</link>><br>
				<</if>>
				<<if ($avery_mansion.kitchen_stock && Array.isArray($avery_mansion.kitchen_stock.requested) && $avery_mansion.kitchen_stock.requested.includes($phase)) && $avery_mansion.kitchen_stock.requested.length gte 3>>
					<<link [[Say you wanted to save it for another time|Mansion Steal Save]]>><</link>><br>
				<<else>>
					<<link [[Say you wanted to save it for another time|Mansion Steal Save Fail]]>><</link>><br>
				<</if>>
				<<if $phase is "pork" or $phase is "beef">>
					<<if ((effectiveTransformationLevel("wolf") gte 6) or (effectiveTransformationLevel("bird") gte 6) or (effectiveTransformationLevel("cat") gte 6) or (effectiveTransformationLevel("bear") gte 6) or (effectiveTransformationLevel("fox") gte 6))>>
						<<link [[Say you wanted to eat <<recipe_name $phase "article">>|Mansion Steal Raw]]>><</link>><br>
					<</if>>
					<<if Object.values($children).find(child => child.mother === "pc" && child.location === "wolf_cave")>>
						<<link [[Say you wanted to feed it to a child|Mansion Steal Child]]>><</link>><br>
					<</if>>
					<<if $syndromewolves gte 1>>
						<<link [[Say you wanted to give it to Black Wolf|Mansion Steal Friend]]>><<set $phase2 to "wolf">><</link>><br>
					<</if>>
					<<if $syndromebird gte 1>>
						<<link [[Say you wanted to give it to the Great Hawk|Mansion Steal Friend]]>><<set $phase2 to "bird">><</link>><br>
					<</if>>
				<</if>>
				<<if (effectiveTransformationLevel("bear") gte 6) and $phase is "wild_honeycomb">>
					<<link [[Say you like honey|Mansion Steal Honey]]>><</link>><br>
				<</if>>
				<<link [[Say you're making a surprise|Mansion Steal Surprise]]>><</link>><br>
				<<link [[Make something up|Mansion Steal Dumb]]>><<set $phase2 to _valid>><</link>><br>
				<<link [[Say you wanted to give it to the orphans|Mansion Steal Orphans]]>><</link>><br>
				<<if effectiveTransformationLevel("fox") gte 2 and $phase is "chicken_egg">>
					<<link [[Defend stealing as your natural need|Mansion Steal Fox]]>><</link>><br>
				<<else>>
					<<link [[Admit to stealing|Mansion Steal Admit]]>><</link>><br>
				<</if>>
			<</if>>
		<</if>>
	<</if>>
<</if>>

:: Widgets Avery Steal [widget]
<<widget "averyKitchenExit">>
	<<set _averyKitchenExitTone to _args[0] ?? "calm">>
	<<set _averyKitchenExitRoll to random(1, 6)>>
	<<if $avery_mansion.schedule is "dinner">>
		<<if _averyKitchenExitTone is "rage">>
			<<switch _averyKitchenExitRoll>>
				<<case 1>>Avery storms back towards the dining room, each step clipped and furious.
				<<case 2>><<He>> returns to the dining room without looking back, too angry to trust <<himself>> with another word.
				<<case 3>>Avery points once at the mess, then leaves before <<his>> temper gets any louder.
				<<case 4>><<He>> straightens <<his>> cuffs with stiff, angry motions before heading back to dinner.
				<<case 5>>Avery's mouth tightens as <<he>> turns away, the silence sharper than another lecture.
				<<default>><<He>> leaves you in the kitchen, anger trailing after <<him>> like heat from an open oven.
			<</switch>>
		<<else>>
			<<switch _averyKitchenExitRoll>>
				<<case 1>>Avery gives the broken glass one last look, then returns to the dining room.
				<<case 2>><<He>> smooths <<his>> sleeve and heads back towards dinner.
				<<case 3>>Avery lingers at the doorway for a moment before deciding the matter is finished.
				<<case 4>><<He>> exhales through <<his>> nose and leaves you with the mess.
				<<case 5>>Avery glances once at your hands, then steps back into the hallway.
				<<default>><<He>> lets the silence settle behind <<him>> as <<he>> goes back to the dining room.
			<</switch>>
		<</if>>
	<<else>>
		<<if _averyKitchenExitTone is "rage">>
			<<switch _averyKitchenExitRoll>>
				<<case 1>>Avery storms out of the kitchen, jaw tight.
				<<case 2>><<He>> leaves before <<his>> temper can spill any further.
				<<case 3>>Avery points once at the mess, then steps out without waiting for an answer.
				<<case 4>><<He>> turns away so sharply that the silence after <<him>> feels like a slammed door.
				<<case 5>>Avery's glare stays on you until the doorway finally takes <<him>> from view.
				<<default>><<He>> leaves you alone with the kitchen and the weight of <<his>> anger.
			<</switch>>
		<<else>>
			<<switch _averyKitchenExitRoll>>
				<<case 1>>Avery gives the broken glass one last look, then leaves the kitchen.
				<<case 2>><<He>> straightens <<his>> cuffs and steps out of the kitchen.
				<<case 3>>Avery lingers at the doorway for a moment before leaving you to the mess.
				<<case 4>><<He>> gives a small shake of <<his>> head and lets the matter drop.
				<<case 5>>Avery looks as if <<he>> might say more, then thinks better of it.
				<<default>><<He>> leaves without another word.
			<</switch>>
		<</if>>
	<</if>>
<</widget>>

<<widget "averyKitchenTheftEscalation">>
	You search for another excuse, but Avery's expression changes before you can find one.
	<br><br>
	<<switch random(1, 4)>>
		<<case 1>>"So that's what it is? A cover-up?" Avery's eye twitches. "I take you in, provide for you, and you come here to steal from me? To sell it yourself? To run off with whatever you can carry?"
		<<case 2>>"No," Avery says, voice dropping. "This was never about a snack, was it? You thought you could take from my kitchen, dress it up as some silly craving, and walk away smiling."
		<<case 3>>Avery looks from the food to the broken glass, and whatever patience <<he>> had left disappears. "You expect me to believe that? After everything I give you, you still sneak around like a thief?"
		<<default>>"Don't insult me," Avery says. <<His>> grip tightens before <<he>> even touches you. "You were stealing from me and hoping I'd be stupid enough to believe whatever excuse came out first."
	<</switch>>
	<br><br>
	<<He>> gets closer and grabs your arm.<<garage>><<gtrauma>><<gstress>><<npcincr Avery rage 3>><<trauma 6>><<stress 6>>
<</widget>>

<<widget "averyKitchenPillConsequence">>
	<<if typeof playerMayBeSpiked === "function" && playerMayBeSpiked()>>
		Avery stops before leaving. For a second, <<he>> only looks at the mess, breathing through <<his>> nose until <<his>> temper finds a colder shape.
		"Maybe making you a little more docile will help. Since asking nicely clearly doesn't."
		<br><br>
		<<He>> walks and catches your chin before you can step back. Something small and bitter presses past your lips. You swallow on reflex, coughing as it goes down.<<gstress>><<stress 6>>
		<br><br>
		<span class="red">Avery has dosed you with a random pill.</span><<xchange-random-spike>><<xchange-seen 3>>
	<<else>>
		Avery stops at the doorway, takes one slow breath, and seems to decide against whatever crossed <<his>> mind.
		"Stay out of trouble for the rest of the week. I mean it."
	<</if>>
	<<set $weekly.theft.avery_mansion.Ban to true>>
<</widget>>

<<widget "averyKitchenNoExcuse">>
	<<switch random(1, 4)>>
		<<case 1>>Avery waits. The quiet stretches until even the broken glass seems loud.
		<<case 2>>You search the floor, the counter, anything but Avery's face. No decent explanation appears.
		<<case 3>>Your excuse dies before it reaches your tongue. Avery notices immediately.
		<<default>>For a moment, you consider another lie. Avery's stare makes it wither.
	<</switch>>
	<br><br>
	<<switch random(1, 4)>>
		<<case 1>>"Nothing?" <<he>> asks, frowning. "Then keep it in my kitchen. You have everything you need here.<<if Array.isArray($avery_mansion.jobs) && $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>> Clean it up.<</if>>"
		<<case 2>>"That's the best answer you have?" Avery's voice goes flat. "Don't take things from my kitchen and then stand there pretending you forgot why.<<if Array.isArray($avery_mansion.jobs) && $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>> Clean up the mess.<</if>>"
		<<case 3>>"So you didn't think past taking it." <<He>> looks from you to the food. "Leave it here.<<if Array.isArray($avery_mansion.jobs) && $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>> And clean up after yourself.<</if>>"
		<<default>>"If you want something from my kitchen, ask," <<he>> says. "Sneaking around and breaking things is a poor way to get fed.<<if Array.isArray($avery_mansion.jobs) && $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>> Clean it up.<</if>>"
	<</switch>><<npcincr Avery rage 1>><<garage>>
<</widget>>

<<widget "IngredientCheck">>
	<<set _knownRecipes to Array()>><<set _validRecipes to Array()>><<set _unvalidRecipes to Array()>>
	<<run Object.keys(setup.foodstuff || {}).forEach(item => { const food = setup.foodstuff[item]; const ingredients = food?.recipe?.ingredients;
		if (!food || food.category !== "dish") return;
		if (item === "wolfbrew" || item === "ghostbrew") return;
		if (!Array.isArray(ingredients) || !ingredients.length) return;
		if (ingredients.includes($phase)) { _validRecipes.pushUnique(item);
			if ($foodstuff?.[item]?.knows_recipe) { _knownRecipes.pushUnique(item);
			}
		} else {
			_unvalidRecipes.pushUnique(item);
		}
	})>>
	<<if _knownRecipes.length>>
		<<set _valid to _knownRecipes[Math.floor(Math.random() * _knownRecipes.length)]>>
	<<elseif _validRecipes.length>>
		<<set _valid to _validRecipes[Math.floor(Math.random() * _validRecipes.length)]>>
	<<else>>
		<<set _valid to "bread">>
	<</if>>
	<<if _unvalidRecipes.length>>
		<<set _unvalid to _unvalidRecipes[Math.floor(Math.random() * _unvalidRecipes.length)]>>
	<<else>>
		<<set _unvalid to "pizza">>
	<</if>>
<</widget>>
